hadiths[297]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1511","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta hai to bhalai kahey ya khamosh rahey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye sareeh hai ke usey nahi bolna chahiye magar jab baat bhalai ho, aur wo hai jiski maslihat zaahir ho, aur jab maslihat key zaahir honay mein shak ho to nahi bolna chahiye."
"1512","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaun sa Musalman afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jis key zabaan aur haath se Musalman mehfooz rahein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1513","Sehel bin Saad se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujhey uski zamaant dey jo uskey donon jabdon key darmiyaan hai aur jo uskey donon paaon key darmiyaan hai to main usey Jannat ki zamaant deta hun. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1514","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak banda aisi baat kehta hai jis mein ghaur nahi karta aur uskey sabab dozakh mein mashriq aur maghrib key darmiyaan se zyada door girta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Yatabayyan key maana hain: Ghaur karta hai ke wo bhalai hai ya nahi."
"1515","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak banda Allah Taala ki raza ki aisi baat kehta hai jiski use parwah nahi hoti aur Allah uskey sabab usey darjaat buland farmata hai, aur beshak banda Allah Taala ki naraazgi ki aisi baat kehta hai jiski use parwah nahi hoti aur uskey sabab dozakh mein girta hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1516","Abu Abdur Rahman Bilaal bin Al-Haaris Muzani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak aadmi Allah Taala ki raza ki aisi baat kehta hai jiska wo gumaan na karta tha ke wo pahunchy gi jahan pahunchi, aur Allah uskey sabab uskey liye apni raza likh deta hai us din tak jab wo us se milega. Aur beshak aadmi Allah key ghazab ki aisi baat kehta hai jiska wo gumaan na karta tha ke wo pahunchy gi jahan pahunchi, aur Allah uskey sabab uskey liye apna ghazab likh deta hai us din tak jab wo us se milega. Ise Maalik ne Muwatta mein aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1517","Sufyan bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey aisi baat bataein jisey main mazboot pakdun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Mera Rab Allah hai, phir saabit qadam raho. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Sab se zyada khauf wali chiz jis se tum mujh par dartey ho kya hai? To Aap ne apni zabaan pakdi, phir farmaya: Ye. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1518","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah key zikr key siwa baat kasrat se na karo, kyonke Allah Taala key zikr key siwa baat ki kasrat dil ki sakhti hai! Aur beshak Allah se sab se door sakht dil hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"1519","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur jisey Allah us shar se bachaey jo uskey donon jabdon key darmiyaan hai aur us shar se jo uskey donon paaon key darmiyaan hai wo Jannat mein dakhil hoga. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1520","Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Nijaat kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Apni zabaan ko rok kar rakho, aur tumhara ghar tumhey kaafi ho, aur apni khata par ro. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1521","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi ka beta subah karta hai to tamaam aaza zabaan ki minnat kartey hain aur kehtey hain: Hamarey baarey mein Allah se dar, kyonke ham terey sath hain: Agar tu seedhi rahi to ham seedhey raheingey aur agar tu tedhi hui to ham tedhey hongey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai. Tukaffirul lisaan key maana hain: Uskey saamney aajizi aur khuzoo karti hain."
"1522","Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey aise amal ki khabar dein jo mujhey Jannat mein dakhil karey aur mujhey dozakh se door karey? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum ne azeem chiz ka sawal kya hai, aur wo us par aasaan hai jis par Allah Taala aasaan farmaye: Allah ki ibaadat karo aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek na thehrao, aur namaz qaim karo, aur zakaat do, aur Ramazan key rozey rakho, aur Baitullah ka Hajj karo agar uski taraf rasta pa sako. Phir farmaya: Kya main tumhey bhalai key darwaazey na bataun? Roza dhaal hai, aur sadqa khata ko bujha deta hai jaisa paani aag ko bujha deta hai, aur aadmi ki raat key darmiyaan namaz. Phir ye aayat padhi: Unkey pehlu bistaron se judaa rehtey hain, yahan tak ke pahunchy: Jo wo amal kartey they (As-Sajdah: 16-17). Phir farmaya: Kya main tumhey muamley key sar aur uskey sutoon aur uski kohaan ki bulandi na bataun? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Muamley ka sar Islam hai, aur uska sutoon namaz hai, aur uski kohaan ki bulandi jihad hai. Phir farmaya: Kya main tumhey us sab key malik na bataun? Main ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. To Aap ne apni zabaan pakdi aur farmaya: Is par rok laga. Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur kya ham jo kehtey hain us par pakdey jaengey? To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari maa tumhey gum paey! Logon ko dozakh mein unkey chehron par unki zabaanon ki katiyon key siwa kya giraati hai? Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai, aur uski sharah is se pehley baab mein guzar chuki hai."
"1523","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum jaantey ho gheebat kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara apne bhai ka zikr us chiz key sath jo wo napasand karta hai. Kaha gaya: Bataein agar merey bhai mein wo ho jo main kehta hun? Aap ne farmaya: Agar us mein wo ho jo tum kehtey ho to tum ne uski gheebat ki, aur agar us mein wo na ho jo tum kehtey ho to tum ne us par bohtaan baandha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1524","Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hajjatul Wada mein Mina mein Yaumun Nahr key khutbey mein farmaya: Beshak tumharey khoon aur tumharey maal aur tumhari izzatein tum par haraam hain jaisa tumharey is din ki hurmat hai, tumharey is maheeney mein, tumharey is sheher mein. Khabardaar! Kya main ne pahunchaya? (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1525","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Tumharey liye Safiya se itna itna kaafi hai. Baaz ruwat ne kaha: Yaani past qad. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak tum ne aisi baat kahi hai ke agar wo samundar key paani key sath mila di jaey to usey badal degi! Unhon-ne kaha: Aur main ne Aap key liye aik insaan ki naql utaari to Aap ne farmaya: Mujhey pasand nahi ke main kisi insaan ki naql utaarun chaahey merey liye itna itna ho. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai. Mazajtahu key maana hain: Usey aise mila diya jis se uska zaaiqa ya khushbu badal jaey uski sakht badbu aur qabaa-hat ki wjah se. Aur ye hadis gheebat se sab se badey rokne walon mein se hai. Allah Taala ne farmaya: Aur wo khuwahish se nahi bolta, wo to wahi hai jo wahi ki jaati hai."
"1526","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab mujhey Meraj karai gai to main aisi qaum par guzra jinkey taanbey key naakhun they jin se wo apne chehrey aur seeney nochtey they. To main ne kaha: Ye kaun hain ae Jibraeel? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye wo hain jo logon key gosht khaatey hain aur unki izzaton mein padtey hain! Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"1527","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har Musalman doosrey Musalman par haraam hai: Uska khoon aur uski izzat aur uska maal. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1528","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne bhai ki izzat ka difaa karey to Allah qayamat key din uskey chehrey se dozakh ko door farmayega. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1529","Itbaan bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se unki taweel mashhoor hadis mein jo Ummeed key baab mein guzar chuki hai, riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz padhney key liye khadey huey aur farmaya: Maalik bin Ad-Dukhshum kahaan hai? To aik aadmi ne kaha: Wo munaafiq hai jo Allah aur uskey Rasool se mohabbat nahi karta. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aisa na kaho, kya tum usey nahi dekhtey ke us ne La ilaha illallah kaha hai aur us se Allah ka chehra chahta hai! Aur beshak Allah ne dozakh par usey haraam kar diya hai jo La ilaha illallah kahey aur us se Allah ka chehra chaahta ho. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Itbaan ain key kasra key sath mashhoor par hai, aur uskey zamma ka hikayat kya gaya hai, aur uskey baad oopar do nuqton wali ta, phir muwahhada ba. Aur Dukhshum daal key zamma aur kha key sukoon aur sheen muqta muqta key zamma key sath hai."
"1530","Kaab bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se unki taweel hadis mein unki tauba key qissey mein jo Tauba key baab mein guzar chuki hai, riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jabke Aap Tabook mein qaum mein baithey huey they: Kaab Maalik ne kya kya? To Bani Salama mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Usey uski chaadar aur apne pehluon mein dekhna ne rok diya hai. To Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Tum ne buri baat kahi, Allah ki qasam ya Rasulullah! Ham us par bhalai key siwa kuchh nahi jaantey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh rahey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Itfaah uskey donon pehlu hain, aur wo apne aap par taajjub ki taraf ishara hai."
"1531","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat maangi to Aap ne farmaya: Usey ijazat do, wo khaandaan ka bura bhai hai? (Muttafaqun aleh). Bukhari ne is se fasaad walon aur shak walon ki gheebat key jawaaz par dalil li hai."
"1532","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main nahi gumaan karta ke fulaan aur fulaan hamarey deen mein se kuchh jaantey hain. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Lais bin Saad jo is hadis key aik rawi hain, ne kaha: Ye do aadmi munaafiqon mein se they."
"1533","Faatima bint Qais (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aai aur kaha: Beshak Abul Jahm aur Muawiya ne mujhey paighaam diya hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raha Muawiya to ghareeb hai jiska maal nahi, aur raha Abul Jahm to wo apne kandhey se asa nahi utaarta. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Aur raha Abu Al-Jahm to aurton ko maarney wala hai. Aur wo riwayat ki tafseer hai: Wo apne kandhey se asa nahi utaarta. Aur kaha gaya: Iskey maana hain: Bahut safar karne wala."
"1534","Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein nikley jis mein logon ko sakhti pahunchi. To Abdullah bin Ubayy ne kaha: Jo Rasulullah key paas hain un par kharch na karo yahan tak ke muntashir ho jaein. Aur kaha: Agar ham Madina wapas aey to izzat wala zaleel ko nikaal dega. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur Aap ko uski khabar di. To Aap ne Abdullah bin Ubayy ki taraf paighaam bheja aur us ne qasam khai ke us ne nahi kya. To unhon-ne kaha: Zaid ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se jhoot kaha. To merey dil mein unkey qaul se sakhti hui yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne meri tasdeeq naazil ki: Jab munaafiq tumharey paas aatey hain. Phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhey bulaya taake unkey liye maghfirat maangein to unhon-ne apne sar pher liye. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1535","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Sufyan ki biwi Hind ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Beshak Abu Sufyan kanjoos aadmi hai aur mujhey wo nahi deta jo mujhey aur merey betey ko kaafi ho siwaey uskey jo main us se lun jabke wo nahi jaanta? Aap ne farmaya: Wo ley lo jo tumhey aur tumharey betey ko dastoor key mutabiq kaafi ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1536","Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chughalkhor Jannat mein dakhil nahi hoga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1537","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) do qabron par guzrey aur farmaya: Beshak unhey azaab diya jaa raha hai, aur unhey badi baat mein azaab nahi diya jaa raha! Kyun nahi, beshak wo badi hai: Raha un mein se aik to wo chugli karta phirta tha, aur raha doosra to wo apne peshaab se nahi bachta tha. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Bukhari ki aik riwayat ka lafz hai). Ulema ne kaha: Wama yuazzabaani fi kabeer key maana hain: Yaani unkey gumaan mein badi, aur kaha gaya: Uska chhorna un par badi hai."
"1538","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey na bataun Aziha kya hai? Wo chugli hai, logon key darmiyaan baat pheelana. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Azihah ain muhmala key fatha aur zaad muqta muqta key sukoon aur ha key sath wajh key wazan par hai, aur riwayat kya gaya: Al-azatu ain key kasra aur zaad muqta muqta key fatha key sath udda key wazan par hai, aur wo jhoot aur bohtaan hai, aur pehli riwayat par: Al-azihu masdar hai, kaha jaata hai: Azahahu azhan, yaani usey aziha key sath maarna."
"1539","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Merey sahaaba mein se koi mujhey kisi key baarey mein koi baat na pahunchaye, kyonke main pasand karta hun ke tumhari taraf niklun jabke mera seena saaf ho. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"1540","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum logon ko kaanein paogey: Jaahiliyat mein unkey behtreen Islam mein unkey behtreen hain jab wo samjhein, aur tum is muamley mein behtreen logon ko paogey jo usey sab se zyada napasand kartey hain, aur tum badtareen logon ko do chehrey waley paogey, jo inkey paas aik chehrey key sath aata hai aur unkey paas aik chehrey key sath. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1541","Muhammad bin Zaid se riwayat hai ke kuchh logon ne unkey dada Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se kaha: Beshak ham apne sultaanon key paas dakhil hotey hain aur un se uskey khilaaf kehtey hain jo ham kehtey hain jab ham unkey paas se nikaltey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Ham isey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key ahd mein nifaaq shumaar kartey they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1542","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak sachchai neki ki taraf rahnumai karti hai, aur beshak neki Jannat ki taraf rahnumai karti hai, aur beshak aadmi sach bolta hai yahan tak ke Allah key paas siddiq likha jaata hai. Aur beshak jhoot gunaah ki taraf rahnumai karta hai, aur beshak gunaah dozakh ki taraf rahnumai karta hai, aur beshak aadmi jhoot bolta hai yahan tak ke Allah key paas kazzaab likha jaata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1543","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chaar hain jo jis mein hon wo khaalis munaafiq tha, aur jis mein un mein se aik khaslat ho us mein nifaaq ki aik khaslat hogi yahan tak ke usey chhor dey: Jab usey amaanat di jaey to khayaanat karey, aur jab baat karey to jhoot boley, aur jab ahd karey to dhoka dey, aur jab jhagda karey to gaali dey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur uska bayaan Abu Hurairah ki hadis key sath is jaisi Wafa Bil Ahd key baab mein guzar chuka hai."
"1544","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aisa khuwab zaahir karey jo us ne nahi dekha to usey takleef di jaeygi ke do jau key daanon key darmiyaan girah lagaye aur wo nahi kar sakega. Aur jo kisi qaum ki baat suney jabke wo usey napasand kartey hain to qayamat key din uskey kaanon mein pighla hua seesa daala jaeyga. Aur jo tasweer banaey to usey azaab diya jaeyga aur takleef di jaeygi ke us mein rooh phunkey aur wo phunka ney wala nahi. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Tahallama yaani: Us ne kaha ke us ne neend mein khuwab dekha aur is is ko dekha, jabke wo jhoota hai. Aur aanuk madd aur noon key zamma aur kaaf key takhfeef key sath hai, aur wo pighla hua seesa hai."
"1545","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab se badey jhoot mein se hai ke aadmi apni aankhon ko wo dikhaey jo unhon-ne nahi dekha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Aur iskey maana hain: Kehta hai: Main ne dekha us mein jo us ne nahi dekha."
"1546","Samura bin Jundab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aksar apne sahaaba se kehtey they: Kya tum mein se kisi ne khuwab dekha hai? To jisey Allah chaahta us par qissa bayan karta. Aur Aap ne ham se aik subah farmaya: Beshak aaj raat merey paas do aaney waley aey, aur unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Chalo, aur main un donon key sath chala. Aur ham chit letey huey aadmi par aey, jabke aik aur us par pathar key sath khada hai, jab wo pathar key sath uskey sar par girta hai to uska sar kuchal deta hai, phir pathar yahan ludhak jaata hai, to pathar key peechey jaata hai taake usey ley. To uski taraf wapas nahi aata yahan tak ke uska sar theek ho jaata hai jaisa tha, phir uski taraf wapas aata hai aur uskey sath waisa karta hai jaisa pehli martaba kya tha! Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne un donon se kaha: Subhan Allah! Ye donon kaun hain? Unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Chalo chalo. To ham chaley aur peeth key bal letey huey aadmi par aey, jabke aik aur lohey key katach key sath us par khada hai, jab wo uskey chehrey key aik pehlu par aata hai to uska jabda guddi tak cheer deta hai, aur uski naak guddi tak, aur uski aankh guddi tak. Phir doosrey pehlu ki taraf palat-ta hai aur uskey sath waisa karta hai jaisa pehley pehlu key sath kya tha. To wo us pehlu se farigh nahi hota yahan tak ke wo pehlu theek ho jaata hai jaisa tha, phir uski taraf wapas aata hai aur waisa karta hai jaisa pehli martaba kya tha. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Subhan Allah? Ye donon kaun hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Chalo chalo. To ham chaley aur tandoor jaisi chiz par aey. To mera khayaal hai ke unhon-ne kaha: To achanak us mein shor aur awazein hain. To ham ne us mein jhaanka to achanak us mein nangey mard aur aurtein hain, jab unkey paas unkey neechey se shola aata hai to wo cheekhtey hain. Main ne kaha: Ye kaun hain? Unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Chalo chalo. To ham chaley aur aik neher par aey. Mera khayaal hai ke wo kehtey they: Surkh khoon ki tarah, jab neher mein aik aadmi tairta hua tair raha hai, jab neher key kinaarey par aik aadmi hai jis ne apne paas bahut sey pathar jama kiye huey hain, jab wo tairney wala tairta hai jitna tairta hai, phir uskey paas aata hai jis ne apne paas pathar jama kiye huey hain, to wo uskey liye apna munh kholta hai aur usey pathar khilata hai, phir wo jaata hai aur tairta hai, phir uski taraf wapas aata hai, jab kabhi uski taraf wapas aata hai to wo uskey liye apna munh kholta hai aur usey pathar khilata hai. Main ne un donon se kaha: Ye donon kaun hain? Unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Chalo chalo. To ham chaley aur buri soorat waley aadmi par aey, ya tum sab se buri soorat dekhtey ho aadmi ko dekhna, jab wo aag key paas hai usey bhadkaata hai aur uskey gird daudta hai. Main ne un donon se kaha: Ye kya hai? Unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Chalo chalo. To ham chaley aur ghani sabz baagh par aey jis mein bahar key har phool mein se hai, jab baagh key darmiyaan mein lamba aadmi hai jiskey sar ko main lambai ki wjah se aasmaan mein shayed hi dekh sakun, jab us aadmi key gird sab se zyada ladkey hain jo main ne kabhi dekhey. Main ne kaha: Ye kya hai! Aur ye kaun hain? Unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Chalo chalo. To ham chaley aur azeem darakht par aey jis se bada aur achchha darakht main ne kabhi nahi dekha! Unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Chadho, mujh se kaha: Us mein chadho. To ham us mein chadhey sheher tak jo soney ki eent aur chaandi ki eent se banaya gaya tha. To ham sheher key darwaazey par aey aur darwaza khulwaaya, to hamarey liye khola gaya aur ham us mein dakhil huey. To ham se aise aadmi miley jinkey jism ka aadha sab se achchha hai jo tum dekhtey ho! Aur un mein se aadha sab se bura hai jo tum dekhtey ho! Unhon-ne un se kaha: Jao aur us neher mein giro, jab wo aisi neher hai jo behti hai goya uska paani safedi mein khaalis doodh hai. To wo gaey aur us mein girey. Phir hamari taraf wapas aey jabke wo burai un se zaaya ho chuki thi, aur wo behtreen soorat mein ho gaey they. Unhon-ne kaha: Unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Ye Adan ki Jannat hai, aur wo tumhara thikana hai. To meri nazar oopar uthi, to achanak safed baadal jaisa mehel hai. Unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Wo tumhara thikana hai? Main ne un donon se kaha: Allah tum donon mein barkat ata farmaye, mujhey chhoro taake main us mein dakhil hun. Unhon-ne kaha: Ab nahi, aur tum us mein dakhil honay waley ho. Main ne un donon se kaha: Beshak main ne aaj raat se ajeeb dekha hai? To ye kya hai jo main ne dekha? Unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Khabardaar! Ham tumhey khabar deingey: Raha pehla aadmi jis par tum aey jiska sar pathar se kuchla jaata hai, to wo aadmi hai jo Quran leta hai aur usey chhor deta hai aur farz namaz se so jaata hai. Aur raha wo aadmi jis par tum aey jiska jabda guddi tak, aur uski naak guddi tak, aur uski aankh guddi tak cheeri jaati hai, to wo aadmi hai jo apne ghar se subah nikalta hai aur jhoot bolta hai jo ufaq tak pahunchta hai. Aur rahey wo nangey mard aur aurtein jo tandoor jaisi imaarat mein hain, to wo zina karne waley mard aur aurtein hain. Aur raha wo aadmi jis par tum aey jo neher mein tairta hai aur pathar khilaya jaata hai, to wo sood khaaney wala hai. Aur raha buri soorat wala aadmi jo aag key paas hai usey bhadkaata hai aur uskey gird daudta hai, to wo Maalik dozakh ka darbaan hai. Aur raha lamba aadmi jo baagh mein hai, to wo Ibrahim hain. Aur rahey wo ladkey jo unkey gird hain, to har bachcha jo fitrat par mara. Aur Barqaani ki riwayat mein hai: Fitrat par paida hua. To baaz Musalmanon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur mushrikon key bachchey? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur mushrikon key bachchey. Aur rahi wo qaum jinka aadha achchha tha aur aadha bura, to wo qaum hain jinhon-ne naik amal aur doosra bura milaya, aur Allah ne un se darguzar kya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Main ne aaj raat do aadmi dekhey jo mujhey laey aur mujhey muqaddas zameen ki taraf nikaal laey. Phir zikr kya aur farmaya: To ham tandoor jaisi surang tak chaley jiska oopar tang aur neechey kushada hai, uskey neechey aag bhadakti hai, phir jab buland hoti hai to wo buland hotey hain yahan tak ke qareeb hotey hain ke niklein, aur jab bujhti hai to us mein wapas aatey hain, aur us mein nangey mard aur aurtein hain. Aur us mein hai: Yahan tak ke ham khoon ki neher par aey, aur shak nahi kya, us mein aik aadmi hai jo neher key darmiyaan mein khada hai, aur neher key kinaarey par aik aadmi hai, aur uskey saamney pathar hain. To neher wala aadmi aaya, phir jab wo nikalna chaahta hai to aadmi uskey munh mein pathar maarta hai aur usey wapas kar deta hai jahan tha. To jab kabhi wo nikalney key liye aata hai to uskey munh mein pathar maarta hai aur wo wapas aata hai jaisa tha. Aur us mein hai: To unhon-ne mujhey darakht par chadhaya aur mujhey aise ghar mein dakhil kya jis se achchha main ne kabhi nahi dekha, us mein boodhey aur jawaan aadmi hain. Aur us mein hai: Jo tum ne dekha jiska jabda cheera jaata hai to jhoota hai, jhoot bolta hai aur us se jhoot uthaya jaata hai yahan tak ke ufaq tak pahunchta hai, to uskey sath qayamat key din tak waisa kya jaeyga jo tum ne dekha. Aur us mein hai: Jo tum ne dekha jiska sar toda jaata hai to aisa aadmi hai jisey Allah ne Quran sikhaya, phir wo raat mein us se soya aur din mein us par amal na kya, to uskey sath qayamat key din tak kya jaeyga. Pehla ghar jis mein tum dakhil huey aam mominon ka ghar hai, aur raha ye ghar to shuhada ka ghar hai. Aur main Jibraeel hun, aur ye Mikaeel hain. Apna sar uthayo. To main ne apna sar uthaya, to merey oopar baadal jaisi chiz hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Wo tumhara thikana hai. Main ne kaha: Mujhey chhoro taake main apne thikaaney mein dakhil hun. Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tumhari umr baqi hai jo tum ne poori nahi ki, phir agar tum usey poori karogey to apne thikaaney mein aaogey. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Uska qaul yaslaghu raasahu sa muqta muqta aur ghain muqta muqta key sath hai, yaani todta aur phaadta hai. Uska qaul yatadahdahu yaani ludhakta hai. Aur kalloob kaaf key fatha aur laam key tashdeed key zamma key sath hai, aur wo maroof hai. Uska qaul fayusharshiru yaani kaat-ta hai. Uska qaul zawzawu wo do zaad muqta muqta key sath hai, yaani cheekhey. Uska qaul fayughiru fa aur ghain muqta muqta key sath hai, yaani kholta hai. Uska qaul almarah meem key fatha key sath hai, yaani manzar. Uska qaul yahushshuha ya key fatha aur ha muhmala key zamma aur sheen muqta muqta key sath hai, yaani usey bhadkaata hai. Uska qaul rauzah mutimmah meem key zamma aur ain key sukoon aur ta key fatha aur meem key tashdeed key sath hai, yaani poorey nabat wali lambi. Uska qaul dauhah daal key fatha aur waao key sukoon aur ha muhmala key sath hai, aur wo bada darakht hai. Uska qaul almahz meem key fatha aur ha muhmala key sukoon aur zaad muqta muqta key sath hai, aur wo doodh hai. Uska qaul fasama basari yaani buland hui. Aur saadan saad aur ain key zamma key sath hai, yaani buland. Aur rababah ra key fatha aur ba muwahhada key takraar key sath hai, aur wo baadal hai."
"1547","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi key liye jhoot honay ko yehi kaafi hai ke wo har suni hui baat bayan karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1548","Samura (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo meri taraf se aisi hadis bayan karey jisey wo jhoot samajhta hai to wo jhoot bolne walon mein se aik hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1549","Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke aik aurat ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri sautan hai, to kya mujh par gunah hai agar main apne shohar se uskey siwa se pait bhara zaahir karun jo wo mujhey deta hai? To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo us se pait bhara zaahir karey jo usey nahi diya gaya wo aisa hai jaisa jhoot key do kapdey pehen-ney wala. (Muttafaqun aleh). Mutashabbi wo hai jo pait bhara zaahir karta hai jabke wo pait bhara nahi, aur yahan iskey maana hain ke wo zaahir karta hai ke usey fazilat haasil hui hai jabke haasil nahi hui. Aur laabis saubai zoor yaani zoor wala, aur wo hai jo logon par jhoot bolta hai ke wo zuhd ya ilm ya dolat walon key libaas se aaraasta ho taake log us se dhoka khaein jabke wo us sifat wala nahi, aur kaha gaya uskey siwa, aur Allah behtar jaanta hai."
"1550","Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey sab se badey kabeera gunaahon ki khabar na dun? Ham ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Allah key sath shirk karna, aur walidain ki nafarmaani. Aur Aap tek lagaey huey they phir baith gaey, phir farmaya: Khabardaar! Aur jhooti baat! To Aap dohratey rahey yahan tak ke ham ne kaha: Kaash Aap khamosh ho jaein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1551","Abu Zaid Saabit bin Az-Zahhaak Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu), jo Bait-e-Rizwaan walon mein se hain, se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Islam key siwa kisi millat par jaan boojh kar jhooti qasam khaey to wo waisa hai jaisa us ne kaha. Aur jo apne aap ko kisi chiz key sath qatl karey to qayamat key din usey us se azaab diya jaeyga. Aur aadmi par us chiz mein nazr nahi jo uskey ikhtiyaar mein nahi. Aur momin par laanat usey qatl karne ki tarah hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1552","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Siddiq key liye munaasib nahi ke wo laanat karne wala ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1553","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Laanat karne waley qayamat key din sifarshi aur gawaah nahi hongey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1554","Samura bin Jundab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aapas mein Allah ki laanat key sath laanat na karo, aur na uskey ghazab key sath, aur na dozakh key sath. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1555","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin taana dene wala, laanat karne wala, behaya aur badzabaan nahi hota. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1556","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak banda jab kisi chiz par laanat karta hai to laanat aasmaan ki taraf chadhti hai, to aasmaan key darwaazey uskey saamney band kar diye jaatey hain. Phir zameen ki taraf utarti hai, to uskey darwaazey uskey saamney band kar diye jaatey hain. Phir daayein aur baayein jaati hai. Phir agar wo jagah na paey to uski taraf wapas aati hai jis par laanat ki gai. Phir agar wo uska ahel ho to, warna kehne waley ki taraf wapas aati hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"1557","Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne baaz safaron mein they, aur Ansaar mein se aik aurat oontni par thi, to wo ukta gai aur us ne us par laanat ki. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye suna aur farmaya: Us par jo hai ley lo aur usey chhor do, kyonke wo maloon hai. Imran ne kaha: To goya main usey ab dekhta hun ke wo logon mein chal rahi hai aur koi us se taarruz nahi karta. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1558","Abu Barza Nazla bin Ubaid Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik martaba aik londi oontni par thi jis par qaum ka kuchh saamaan tha, jab us ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha aur pahaad ne un par tangi ki, to us ne kaha: Hal, ae Allah us par laanat farma. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamarey sath wo oontni na rahey jis par laanat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Uska qaul hal ha muhmala key fatha aur laam key sukoon key sath hai, aur wo oonton ko haank-ney ka kalima hai. Aur jaan lo ke is hadis key maana mein ishkaal ho sakta hai lekin koi ishkaal nahi, balke muraad us oontni ki Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath rehney se mana karna hai, aur us mein usey baichney aur zibah karne aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat key siwa us par sawaar honay se mana nahi hai, balke ye tamaam tasarrufaat aur uskey siwa jaez hain, un mein koi mana nahi siwaey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat mein usey rakhne key, kyonke ye tamaam tasarrufaat jaez they, to baaz se mana kya gaya aur baqi us par raha jo tha, aur Allah behtar jaanta hai."
"1559","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ko gaali dena fisq hai, aur us se qitaal karna kufr hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1560","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Koi aadmi kisi aadmi par fisq ya kufr ki tohmat nahi lagaata magar wo uski taraf wapas aati hai, agar uska saathi aisa na ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1561","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gaali dene waley donon ne jo kaha uska gunah pehel karne waley par hai yahan tak ke mazloom hadd se badhey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1562","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aik aadmi laaya gaya jis ne sharab pi thi. Aap ne farmaya: Usey maaro. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: To ham mein se haath se maarney wala, aur jootey se maarney wala, aur kapdey se maarney wala tha. Phir jab wo wapas aaya to qaum mein se baaz ne kaha: Allah tumhey ruswa karey. Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na kaho, us par shaitaan ki madad na karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1563","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo apne ghulaam par zina ki tohmat lagaey to qayamat key din us par hadd qaim ki jaeygi, siwaey iskey ke wo waisa ho jaisa us ne kaha. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1564","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Murdon ko bura na kaho kyonke wo uski taraf pahunch chukey jo unhon-ne aagey bheja tha. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1565","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman wo hai jiski zabaan aur haath se Musalman mehfooz rahein, aur muhaajir wo hai jo usey chhor dey jis se Allah ne mana farmaya hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1566","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo chahta hai ke usey dozakh se door kya jaey aur Jannat mein dakhil kya jaey to uski maut usey is haal mein aey ke wo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhta ho, aur logon key paas wo ley kar aey jo wo pasand karta hai ke uskey paas laaya jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur wo taweel hadis ka hissa hai jo Hukmraanon ki itaat key baab mein guzar chuki hai."
"1567","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aapas mein bughz na rakho, aur hasad na karo, aur peeth na phero, aur qata talluq na karo, aur Allah key bando bhai bhai hojao. Aur Musalman key liye halaal nahi ke wo apne bhai se teen se zyada qata talluq karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1568","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat key darwaazey peer aur jumeraat key din kholey jaatey hain, to har bandey ko bakhsh diya jaata hai jo Allah key sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehrata, siwaey us aadmi key jiskey aur uskey bhai key darmiyaan dushmani ho. To kaha jaata hai: In donon ko dekhtey raho yahan tak ke sulah kar lein! In donon ko dekhtey raho yahan tak ke sulah kar lein! Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Aamaal har jumeraat aur peer key din pesh kiye jaatey hain, aur isi tarah zikr kya."
"1569","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hasad se bacho, kyonke hasad nekiyon ko kha jaata hai jaisa aag lakdi ko khaati hai, ya farmaya: Ghaas ko. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"1570","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Badgumaani se bacho, kyonke badgumaani sab se jhooti baat hai. Aur kaan na lagayo, aur jaasoosi na karo, aur muqaabla na karo, aur hasad na karo, aur bughz na rakho, aur peeth na phero, aur Allah key bando bhai bhai hojao jaisa tumhey hukm diya gaya hai. Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai, wo us par zulm nahi karta, aur usey ruswa nahi karta, aur usey haqeer nahi samajhta. Taqwa yahaan hai, aur apne seeney ki taraf ishara farmaya. Aadmi key liye shar se yehi kaafi hai ke wo apne Musalman bhai ko haqeer samjhey. Har Musalman doosrey Musalman par haraam hai: Uska khoon, aur uski izzat, aur uska maal. Beshak Allah tumharey jismon ki taraf nahi dekhta, aur na tumhari sooraton ki taraf, lekin tumharey dilon aur tumharey aamaal ki taraf dekhta hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Hasad na karo, aur bughz na rakho, aur jaasoosi na karo, aur kaan na lagayo, aur boli na badhao, aur Allah key bando bhai bhai hojao. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Qata talluq na karo, aur peeth na phero, aur bughz na rakho, aur hasad na karo, aur Allah key bando bhai bhai hojao. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Hijrat na karo aur tum mein se koi doosrey key sauda par sauda na karey. Ise Muslim ne in tamaam riwayaat key sath riwayat kya hai, aur Bukhari ne aksar riwayat kya hai."
"1571","Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak agar tum Musalmanon key aibon key peechey padogey to unhey bigaad dogey, ya unhey bigaadney key qareeb ho jaogey. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1572","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unkey paas aik aadmi laaya gaya aur un se kaha gaya: Ye fulaan hai jiski daadhi se sharab tapak rahi hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak hamein jaasoosi se mana kya gaya hai, lekin agar hamarey liye kuchh zaahir ho jaey to ham usey pakdeingey. Hasan sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud ne Bukhari aur Muslim ki shart par sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1573","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Badgumaani se bacho, kyonke badgumaani sab se jhooti baat hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1574","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi key liye shar se yehi kaafi hai ke wo Musalman ko haqeer samjhey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai, aur ye qareeb hi apni taveel soorat mein guzar chuki hai."
"1575","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat mein wo dakhil nahi hoga jiskey dil mein zarra barabar takabbur ho. To aik aadmi ne kaha: Beshak aadmi pasand karta hai ke uska kapda achchha ho aur uska joota achchha ho. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah khubsurat hai aur khubsurti ko pasand farmata hai. Takabbur haq ko thukrana hai aur logon ko haqeer samajhna hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Batarul haqq key maana hain: Usey dhakelna. Aur ghamtuhum unhey haqeer samajhna hai. Aur uska bayaan is se zyada wazeh Takabbur key baab mein guzar chuka hai."
"1576","Jundab bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik aadmi ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Allah fulaan ko nahi bakhshega. To Allah Azza wa Jall ne farmaya: Wo kaun hai jo mujh par qasam khaata hai ke main fulaan ko nahi bakhshunga! To beshak main ne usey bakhsh diya aur tumhara amal zaaya kar diya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1577","Waasila bin Al-Asqa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne bhai par shamaatat zaahir na karo, kyonke Allah us par rehem farmayega aur tumhey aazmaaish mein daalega. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur is baab mein Abu Hurairah ki peechli hadis hai Jaasoosi key baab mein: Har Musalman doosrey Musalman par haraam hai, ye hadis."
"1578","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon mein do baatein hain jo unkey sabab kufr hain: Nasab mein taana, aur mayyit par noha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1579","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ham par hathyaar uthaye wo ham mein se nahi, aur jo hamein dhoka dey wo ham mein se nahi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khaaney key dher par guzrey aur apna haath us mein daala, to Aap ki ungliyon ne geela paaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae khaaney waley ye kya hai? Us ne kaha: Usey baarish lagi hai ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: To tum ne usey khaaney key oopar kyun na kya taake log usey dekhein! Jo hamein dhoka dey wo ham mein se nahi."
"1580","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Boli na badhao. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1581","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne najsh se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1582","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya gaya ke wo khareed o farokht mein dhoka khaata hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne kissey baiyat ki? To kaho: Dhoka nahi. (Muttafaqun aleh). Khilaabah kha muqta muqta key kasra aur ba muwahhada key sath hai, aur wo dhoka hai."
"1583","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi aadmi ki biwi ya uskey ghulaam ko bigaadey wo ham mein se nahi. Khabbaba kha muqta muqta, phir ba muwahhada key takraar key sath hai, yaani: Usey bigaada aur dhoka diya."
"1584","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chaar hain jo jis mein hon wo khaalis munaafiq tha, aur jis mein un mein se aik khaslat ho us mein nifaaq ki aik khaslat hogi yahan tak ke usey chhor dey: Jab usey amaanat di jaey to khayaanat karey, aur jab baat karey to jhoot boley, aur jab ahd karey to dhoka dey, aur jab jhagda karey to gaali dey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1585","Ibn Masood aur Ibn Umar aur Anas (Raziallahu anhum) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har dhoka karne waley key liye qayamat key din jhanda hoga, kaha jaeyga: Ye fulaan ki dhoka hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1586","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har dhoka karne waley key liye qayamat key din uskey peechey jhanda hoga jo uskey dhokey key barabar buland kya jaeyga. Khabardaar! Aam haakim se bada dhoka karne wala koi nahi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1587","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala ne farmaya: Teen hain jinka main qayamat key din dushman hun: Aik aadmi jis ne merey naam par diya phir dhoka kya, aur aik aadmi jis ne aazaad ko baicha aur uski qeemat khai, aur aik aadmi jis ne mazdoor ko kiraye par liya aur us se poora liya aur usey uska ujrat na di. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1588","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen hain jin se Allah qayamat key din kalaam nahi farmayega aur na unki taraf nazar farmayega, aur na unhey paak farmayega, aur unkey liye dardnaak azaab hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey teen martaba padha. Abu Zarr ne kaha: Wo naakaam aur khasaarey mein rahey, wo kaun hain ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Tehband latkaney wala, aur ehsaan jatlaney wala, aur apna saamaan jhooti qasam se baichney wala. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Apna tehband latkaney wala, yaani: Apna tehband aur kapda takhnon se neechey takabbur key liye latkaney wala."
"1589","Iyaaz bin Himaar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala ne meri taraf wahi ki hai ke aajizi karo yahan tak ke koi kisi par zulm na karey, aur koi kisi par fakhr na karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Ahl-e-lughat ne kaha: Baghi: Zulm aur ziyadati hai."
"1590","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi kahey: Log halaak ho gaey, to wo unhey sab se zyada halaak karne wala hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Mashhoor riwayat hai: Ahlakahum kaaf key rafa key sath, aur uskey nasb key sath riwayat kya gaya hai, aur ye haraam hai. Aur jo usey apne aap par taajjub ki wjah se, aur logon ko haqeer samajhney, aur un par bulandi ki wjah se kahey to ye haraam hai. Aur jo usey logon mein deen key muamley mein kami dekhney ki wjah se kahey, aur un par aur deen par ghum key sabab kahey to koi harj nahi. Is tarah ulema ne tafseer ki hai aur tafseel ki hai, aur jin aimma aalaam ne usey kaha hai un mein Maalik bin Anas aur Khattaabi aur Humaidi aur aakhiron hain, aur main ne usey Azkaar kitaab mein wazeh kya hai."
"1591","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qata talluq na karo, aur peeth na phero, aur bughz na rakho, aur hasad na karo, aur Allah key bando bhai bhai hojao. Aur Musalman key liye halaal nahi ke wo apne bhai se teen se zyada qata talluq karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1592","Abu Ayyub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman key liye halaal nahi ke wo apne bhai se teen raaton se zyada qata talluq karey: Wo donon miltey hain, to ye munh pherta hai aur ye munh pherta hai, aur un donon mein behtar wo hai jo salaam mein pehel karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1593","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aamaal har peer aur jumeraat mein pesh kiye jaatey hain, to Allah har shakhs ko bakhsh deta hai jo Allah key sath kisi chiz ko shareek nahi thehrata, siwaey us shakhs key jiskey aur uskey bhai key darmiyaan dushmani ho. To farmata hai: In donon ko chhoro yahan tak ke sulah kar lein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1594","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak shaitaan naumeed ho gaya hai ke use namaz padhney waley Jazeeratul Arab mein poojengey, lekin fasad daalney mein aur unkey darmiyaan uksaaney mein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Tahreesh: Fasaad daalna aur unkey dilon ko badalna aur qata talluq karna hai."
"1595","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman key liye halaal nahi ke wo apne bhai se teen se zyada qata talluq karey. To jo teen se zyada qata talluq karey aur mar jaey to dozakh mein dakhil hoga. Ise Abu Dawud ne Bukhari ki shart par sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1596","Abu Khiraash Hadrad bin Abi Hadrad Aslami, aur kaha gaya Sulami Sahaabi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo apne bhai se aik saal qata talluq karey to wo uska khoon bahaaney ki tarah hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1597","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin key liye halaal nahi ke wo momin se teen se zyada qata talluq karey. Phir agar us par teen guzar jaein to wo us se miley aur usey salaam karey. Phir agar us ne usey salaam ka jawab diya to wo donon ajr mein shareek ho gaey, aur agar us ne usey jawab na diya to wo gunah key sath wapas aaya, aur Musalman qata talluq se nikal gaya. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Jab qata talluq Allah Taala key liye ho to wo is mein se kuchh nahi."
"1598","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab teen hon to do teesrey ko chhor kar sargoshi na karein. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai aur izafa kya hai: Abu Saalih ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se kaha: To chaar? Unhon-ne kaha: Tumhey nuqsaan nahi dega. Aur Maalik ne Muwatta mein Abdullah bin Deenaar se riwayat kya hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main aur Ibn Umar Khaalid bin Uqba key ghar key paas they jo bazaar mein hai. To aik aadmi aaya jo us se sargoshi karna chaahta tha, jabke Ibn Umar key sath merey siwa koi na tha. To Ibn Umar ne aik aur aadmi ko bulaya yahan tak ke ham chaar ho gaey. To unhon-ne mujh se aur teesrey aadmi se kaha jisey unhon-ne bulaya tha: Thoda peechey hato, kyonke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Do aik ko chhor kar sargoshi na karein."
"1599","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum teen ho to do doosrey ko chhor kar sargoshi na karein yahan tak ke logon mein mil jao, kyonke wo usey ghumgeen karta hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1600","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aik aurat ko billi mein azaab diya gaya jisey us ne qaid kya yahan tak ke wo mar gai, to wo uskey sabab dozakh mein dakhil hui. Na us ne usey khilaya aur pilaya jab us ne usey qaid kya, aur na usey chhora ke wo zameen key keerhey makodhey khaey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Khashaashul arz kha muqta muqta key fatha aur sheen muqta muqta key takraar key sath hai, aur wo uskey keerhey makodhey hain."
"1601","Unhin se riwayat hai ke wo Quraish key ladkon key paas se guzrey jinhon-ne parinda nasb kya tha aur us par teer maar rahey they, aur unhon-ne parindey waley key liye apne teeron mein se har khata karne waley teer ko muqarrar kya tha. Phir jab unhon-ne Ibn Umar ko dekha to muntashir ho gaey. To Ibn Umar ne kaha: Ye kis ne kya? Allah us par laanat farmaye jis ne ye kya. Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us par laanat ki hai jo kisi jaandaar chiz ko nishaana banaey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Gharaz ghain muqta muqta key fatha aur ra key sath hai, aur wo nishaana hai, aur wo chiz jis par teer maara jaey."
"1602","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jaanwaron ko baandh kar maarney se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur iskey maana hain: Qatl key liye qaid karna."
"1603","Abu Ali Suwaid bin Muqarrin (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne apne aap ko Bani Muqarrin key saat mein saatwaan dekha jabke hamarey paas aik khaadim key siwa koi na thi, hamarey sab se chhotey ne usey thappad maara. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke usey aazaad karein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Merey saat bhaiyon mein saatwaan."
"1604","Abu Masood Badri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main apne aik ghulaam ko kodey se maar raha tha. To main ne apne peechey se awaz suni: Jaan lo ae Abu Masood! To main ghussey ki wjah se awaz na samajh saka. Phir jab wo mujh se qareeb aaya to wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) they, jab wo farmatey they: Jaan lo ae Abu Masood! Ke Allah tum par tum se zyada qaadir hai jo tum is ghulaam par ho. To main ne kaha: Main uskey baad kabhi ghulaam nahi maarunga. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To kodey merey haath se uskey roab se gir gaya. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Wo Allah Taala key liye aazaad hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Agar tum na kartey to tumhey dozakh jhulas deti, ya tumhey dozakh chhooti. Ise Muslim ne in riwayaat key sath riwayat kya hai."
"1605","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulaam ko aisi hadd mein maarey jo us ne nahi ki, ya usey thappad maarey to uska kaffara hai ke usey aazaad karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1606","Hishaam bin Hakeem bin Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Shaam mein Anbaat mein se kuchh logon par guzrey jabke unhey dhoop mein khada kya gaya tha aur unkey saron par tail daala gaya tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Ye kya hai? Unhey khiraaj mein azaab diya jaa raha hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Unhey jizya mein qaid kya gaya hai. To Hishaam ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Allah unhey azaab dega jo logon ko duniya mein azaab detey hain. To wo ameer key paas dakhil huey aur usey hadis bayan ki, to us ne unkey baarey mein hukm diya aur wo chhor diye gaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Anbaat ajam key kisaan hain."
"1607","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chehrey par daagha hua gadha dekha aur usey bura jaana? To farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Main usey chehrey key sab se door hissey key siwa daagh nahi dunga. Aur apne gadhey ka hukm diya aur wo uskey kulhon mein daagha gaya. To wo sab se pehla hai jis ne kulhon mein daagha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Jaa'irataan kulhon key gird gudaa key kinarey hain."
"1608","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par aik gadha guzra jiskey chehrey par daagh diya gaya tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah us par laanat farmaye jis ne usey daagha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein bhi hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chehrey par maarney se aur chehrey par daaghney se mana farmaya."
"1609","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein aik lashkar mein bheja aur farmaya: Agar tum fulaan aur fulaan ko pao, Quraish mein se do aadmiyon key liye jinhey Aap ne naam liya tha, to unhey aag key sath jala do. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jab ham nikalna chaahey: Beshak main ne tumhey hukm diya tha ke fulaan aur fulaan ko jalao, aur aag key sath sirf Allah azaab deta hai. Phir agar tum unhey pao to unhey qatl karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1610","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath safar mein they. To Aap apni haajat key liye gaey. To ham ne surkh chidya dekhi jiskey sath do bachchey they. To ham ne uskey donon bachchey ley liye. To surkh chidya aai aur par phadphadaaney lagi. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laey aur farmaya: Kis ne isey uskey bachchey key sabab ghamgeen kya? Uskey bachchey uski taraf wapas karo. Aur Aap ne cheontiyon ki basti dekhi jisey ham ne jala diya tha. To farmaya: Ye kis ne jalaaya? Ham ne kaha: Ham ne. Aap ne farmaya: Aag key sath azaab dena sirf aag key Rab ko laaiq hai. Uska qaul qaryatu naml key maana hain: Cheontiyon ki jagah cheontiyon key sath."
"1611","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maaldaar ka taal matol karna zulm hai, aur jab tum mein se kisi ko maaldaar par hawala kya jaey to uski pairwi karey. (Muttafaqun aleh. Utbi'a key maana hain: Hawala kya gaya)."
"1612","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne hibah mein wapas aey wo kuttey ki tarah hai jo apni qai mein wapas aata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Uski misaal jo apne sadqey mein wapas aata hai, kuttey ki tarah hai jo qai karta hai, phir apni qai mein wapas aata hai aur usey khaata hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Apne hibah mein wapas aaney wala apni qai mein wapas aaney waley ki tarah hai."
"1613","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Allah key rastey mein ghodey par sawaar kya to us ne usey zaaya kar diya jiskey paas wo tha. To main ne usey khareedna chaaha aur gumaan kya ke wo usey sastay mein baichega. To main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Usey na khareedo aur apne sadqey mein wapas na aao chaahey wo tumhey aik dirham mein dey. Kyonke apne sadqey mein wapas aaney wala apni qai mein wapas aaney waley ki tarah hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Uska qaul hamaltu ala farasin fi sabeelillah key maana hain: Main ne usey baaz mujaahidon ko sadqa kya tha."
"1614","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saat halaak karne waley gunaahon se bacho. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur wo kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key sath shirk karna, aur jaadu, aur us jaan ko qatl karna jisey Allah ne haraam kya hai siwaey haq key, aur sood khaana, aur yateem ka maal khaana, aur ladai key din peeth pherna, aur paakdaaman momin ghafil aurton par tohmat lagaana. (Muttafaqun aleh. Mobiqaat halaak karne waley hain)."
"1615","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sood khaaney waley aur khilaaney waley par laanat ki. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Tirmizi waghera ne izafa kya hai: Aur uskey donon gawaahon par, aur uskey likhney waley par."
"1616","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah Taala ne farmaya: Main shareekon mein shirk se sab se be-niyaaz hun. Jo aisa amal karey jis mein wo merey sath ghair ko shareek karey to main usey aur uskey shirk ko chhor deta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1617","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak sab se pehley jin par qayamat key din faisla kya jaeyga aik aadmi hai jo shaheed hua. To usey laaya jaeyga aur usey apni naimat pehchanaayega aur wo usey pehchaaneyga. Allah farmayega: To tum ne us mein kya amal kya? Wo kaheyga: Main ne Teri raah mein qitaal kya yahan tak ke shaheed hua. Allah farmayega: Tum ne jhoot kaha, lekin tum ne isliye qitaal kya taake kaha jaey: Bahadur hai. To kaha gaya. Phir uskey baarey mein hukm diya jaeyga aur wo apne chehrey key bal ghaseeta jaeyga yahan tak ke dozakh mein daala jaeyga. Aur aik aadmi jis ne ilm seekha aur sikhaya, aur Quran padha. To usey laaya jaeyga aur usey apni naimatein pehchanaayega aur wo usey pehchaaneyga. Allah farmayega: To tum ne us mein kya amal kya? Wo kaheyga: Main ne ilm seekha aur sikhaya aur Teri raah mein Quran padha. Allah farmayega: Tum ne jhoot kaha, lekin tum ne isliye seekha taake kaha jaey: Aalim hai. Aur Quran isliye padha taake kaha jaey: Wo qaari hai. To kaha gaya. Phir uskey baarey mein hukm diya jaeyga aur wo apne chehrey key bal ghaseeta jaeyga yahan tak ke dozakh mein daala jaeyga. Aur aik aadmi jis par Allah ne kushadgi ki aur usey maalon ki aqsaam mein se diya. To usey laaya jaeyga aur usey apni naimatein pehchanaayega aur wo usey pehchaaneyga. Allah farmayega: To tum ne us mein kya amal kya? Wo kaheyga: Main ne koi rasta nahi chhora jis mein Tu kharch karna pasand farmata hai magar us mein Teri raah mein kharch kya. Allah farmayega: Tum ne jhoot kaha, lekin tum ne isliye kya taake kaha jaey: Sakhi hai. To kaha gaya. Phir uskey baarey mein hukm diya jaeyga aur wo apne chehrey key bal ghaseeta jaeyga phir dozakh mein daala jaeyga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Jaree jeem key fatha aur ra key kasra aur madd key sath hai, yaani: Bahadur hoshiyaar."
"1618","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke kuchh logon ne un se kaha: Beshak ham apne sultaanon key paas dakhil hotey hain aur un se uskey khilaaf kehtey hain jo ham kehtey hain jab ham unkey paas se nikaltey hain? Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ne kaha: Ham isey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key ahd mein nifaaq shumaar kartey they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1619","Jundab bin Abdullah bin Sufyan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo sunaye to Allah usey sunaayega, aur jo dikhaawa karey to Allah usey dikhaayega. (Muttafaqun aleh). Ise Muslim ne bhi Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki riwayat se naql kya hai. Samma'a meem key tashdeed key sath hai, aur iskey maana hain: Apna amal logon ko riya key liye zaahir kya. Samma'allahu bihi yaani qayamat key din usey ruswa karega. Aur raa'a key maana hain: Jo logon ko naik amal zaahir karey taake unkey nazdeek azeem ho, raa'allahu bihi yaani uski posheeda haalat makhlooq key sardaron par zaahir karega."
"1620","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aisa ilm seekhey jis se Allah Azza wa Jall ka chehra chaaha jaata hai aur usey sirf isliye seekhey taake us se duniya ki cheez haasil karey to wo qayamat key din Jannat ki khushbu nahi paayega, yaani uski khushbu. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai. Aur is baab mein bahut si mashhoor ahadis hain."
"1621","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha gaya: Bataein wo aadmi jo bhalai ka amal karta hai aur log us par uski tareef kartey hain? Aap ne farmaya: Ye momin ki fauri bashaarat hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1622","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi key betey par zina mein se uska hissa likha gaya hai jo wo zaroor paayega: Aankhon ka zina dekhna hai, aur kaanon ka zina sun-na hai, aur zabaan ka zina baat karna hai, aur haath ka zina pakadna hai, aur paaon ka zina chalna hai, aur dil khuwahish karta hai aur tamanna karta hai, aur sharmgaah usey sach karti hai ya jhoot. (Muttafaqun aleh. Aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai, aur Bukhari ki riwayat mukhtasar hai)."
"1623","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raaston mein baith-ney se bacho. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hamarey liye hamari majlison se bachna nahi hai, ham us mein baat kartey hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir agar tum majlis key siwa nahi maantey to raastey ko uska haq do. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur raastey ka haq kya hai ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Nigaah neechey karna, aur takleef rokna, aur salaam ka jawab dena, aur bhalai ka hukm aur burai se rokna. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1624","Abu Talha Zaid bin Sehel (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham sehnon mein baithey baat kartey they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashreef laey aur ham par khadey huey aur farmaya: Tumhey kya hai aur raaston ki majlison se? To ham ne kaha: Ham to baghair kisi harj key baithey hain, ham yaad kartey hain aur baat kartey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Agar nahi to uska haq ada karo: Nigaah neechey karna, aur salaam ka jawab dena, aur achchhi baat karna. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Su'udaat saad aur ain key zamma key sath hai, yaani: Raastey."
"1625","Jareer (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se achanak nazar key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Apni nazar pher lo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1626","Umm Salama (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas thi aur Aap key paas Maimoona thein. To Ibn Umm Maktoom aey, aur ye uskey baad tha jab hamein hijaab ka hukm diya gaya tha. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us se parda karo. To ham ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya wo andha nahi hai jo hamein nahi dekhta aur hamein nahi pehchaanta? To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum donon andhi ho? Kya tum usey nahi dekhtin?! Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1627","Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mard mard key satr ki taraf na dekhey, aur aurat aurat key satr ki taraf na dekhey. Aur mard mard key sath aik kapdey mein na miley, aur aurat aurat key sath aik kapdey mein na miley. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1628","Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurton key paas daakhil honay se bacho. To Ansaar mein se aik aadmi ne kaha: Bataein hamu? Aap ne farmaya: Hamu maut hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Hamu shohar ka qareebi hai jaisa uska bhai, aur uskey bhai ka beta, aur uskey chacha ka beta."
"1629","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi kisi aurat se tanhai mein na miley magar mehram key sath. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1630","Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujaahidon ki aurton ki hurmat baith-ney walon par unki maaon ki hurmat ki tarah hai. Baith-ney walon mein se jo aadmi mujaahidon mein se kisi aadmi key peechey uskey ghar walon mein khalifa bano, phir un mein us se khayaanat karey to qayamat key din uskey liye khada kya jaeyga aur wo uski nekiyon mein se jitna chaahey ley lega yahan tak ke raazi ho jaey. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamari taraf mutawajjah huey aur farmaya: Tumhara kya gumaan hai? Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1631","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mardon mein se hijron par aur aurton mein se mardaani aurton par laanat ki. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mardon mein se aurton key sath mushabihat karne walon par aur aurton mein se mardon key sath mushabihat karne waliyon par laanat ki. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1632","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us mard par laanat ki jo aurat ka libaas pehney, aur us aurat par jo mard ka libaas pehney. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1633","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dozakh walon mein se do qismein hain jinhey main ne nahi dekha: Aik qaum jinkey paas gaayon ki dumon jaisey kodey hain jin se wo logon ko maartey hain. Aur aurtein jo kapdey pehen-ney wali nangim hon, jo maa'il honay wali maa'il karne wali hon, unkey sar Bukhti oonton ki jhuki hui kohaanon ki tarah hon. Wo Jannat mein dakhil nahi hongi aur na uski khushbu paayengi, jabke uski khushbu itni itni musaafat se paai jaati hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Kaasiyaat key maana hain: Yaani Allah ki naimat se, aariyaat uskey shukr se. Aur kaha gaya iskey maana hain: Wo apne badan ka baaz hissa dhaanpti hai aur baaz kholti hai apni haalat waghera zaahir karne key liye. Aur kaha gaya: Iskey maana hain: Wo bareek kapda pehenti hai jo uskey badan ka rang zaahir karta hai. Aur raha maa'ilaat to kaha gaya: Iskey maana hain: Allah ki itaat se, aur jo un par laazim hai uski hifaazat se. Mumilaat yaani wo ghair ko unka mazmoom fail sikhaati hain. Aur kaha gaya: Maa'ilaat itrati hui chalti hain, mumilaat apne kandhey matkati hain. Aur kaha gaya: Maa'ilaat tedhi maang nikaalti hain, aur wo bighyon ki maang hai. Mumilaat ghair ko wo maang nikaalti hain. Aur ruoosuhunna ka-asnimatil bukht key maana hain: Ke wo unhey amaama ya patti waghera lapet kar badi aur azeem karti hain."
"1634","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Baayein haath se na khao, kyonke shaitaan baayein haath se khaata aur peeta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1635","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi baayein haath se na khaey aur na us se piye. Kyonke shaitaan baayein haath se khaata hai aur us se peeta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1636","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Yahood aur Nasaara khizaab nahi lagatey, isliye unki mukhaalifat karo. (Muttafaqun aleh). Muraad hai: Safed daadhi aur sar key baalon ko zard ya surkh rangna. Aur raha kaala to us se mana kya gaya hai jaisa ham agley baab mein zikr kareingey, Insha Allah Taala."
"1637","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Fatah Makkah key din Abu Quhaafa jo Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziallahu anhuma) key waalid hain, laey gaey jabke unka sar aur daadhi sagaamey ki tarah safed thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Isey badlo aur kaaley se bacho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1638","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qaza se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1639","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik bachchey ko dekha jiskey sar key baaz baal moonDey gaey they aur baaz chhorey gaey they. To Aap ne unhey us se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Usey poora moondo ya poora chhoro. Ise Abu Dawud ne Bukhari aur Muslim ki shart par sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1640","Abdullah bin Jaafar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aale Jaafar (Raziallahu anhu) ko teen mohlat di, phir unkey paas aey aur farmaya: Aaj key baad merey bhai par na rona. Phir farmaya: Merey bhai key beton ko merey liye bulao. To ham laey gaey goya ham chidya key bachchey hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Merey liye hajjaam ko bulao. To usey hukm diya aur us ne hamarey sar moonDey. Ise Abu Dawud ne Bukhari aur Muslim ki shart par sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1641","Ali se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aurat key apna sar moonDney se mana farmaya. Ise Nasaai ne riwayat kya hai."
"1642","Asma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai: Ke aik aurat ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri beti ko khasra nikla aur uskey baal jhad gaey, aur beshak main ne uski shaadi ki hai, to kya main us mein jor lagaaun? To Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne jor lagaaney wali aur jisey jor lagaya jaey us par laanat ki hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Jor lagaaney wali aur lagwaanay wali. Uska qaul fatamarraqa ra key sath hai, aur iskey maana hain: Bikhhar gaya aur gir gaya. Walwaasilah wo hai jo apne baal ya ghair key baal doosrey baal key sath jorti hai. Walmausoolah wo hai jiskey baal jorey jaatey hain. Walmustausilah wo hai jo us se maangti hai jo uskey liye ye karey."
"1643","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se isi tarah riwayat hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1644","Humaid bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se suna jis saal unhon-ne Hajj kya tha mimbar par jabke unhon-ne baalon ka jooda liya jo sipahi key haath mein tha. To unhon-ne kaha: Ae Ahle Madina! Tumharey ulema kahaan hain? Main ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is jaisi se mana farmatey huey suna hai aur Aap farmatey they: Bani Israeel halaak huey jab unki aurton ne ye apnaaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1645","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jor lagaaney wali aur lagwaanay wali aur godney wali aur gudwaanay wali par laanat ki. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1646","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Allah ne godney waliyon aur gudwaanay waliyon aur bhunwein ukhaadney waliyon aur daanton mein kushadgi karne waliyon par husn key liye laanat ki hai, jo Allah ki khilqat ko badalti hain! To us se aik aurat ne is baarey mein kaha. To unhon-ne kaha: Aur mujhey kya hai ke main us par laanat na karun jis par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne laanat ki hai jabke wo Allah ki kitaab mein hai?! Allah Taala ne farmaya: Aur jo Rasool tumhey dey wo ley lo aur jis se tumhey mana karey us se ruk jao (Al-Hashr: 7). (Muttafaqun aleh). Mutafallijah wo hai jo apne daanton mein se thanda karke baaz ko baaz se thoda door karti hai aur unhey khubsurat karti hai, aur wo wash r hai. Aur naamisah wo hai jo ghair ki bhunwein key baal leyti hai aur unhey bareek karti hai taake khubsurat ho jaey. Aur mutanam misah wo hai jo usey hukm deti hai jo uskey sath ye karey."
"1647","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aisa amal karey jis par hamara hukm nahi to wo radd hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1648","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi peshaab karey to apne aala ko daayein haath se na pakdey, aur na daayein haath se istinja karey, aur na bartan mein saans ley. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur is baab mein bahut si sahih ahadis hain."
"1649","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi aik jootey mein na chaley, donon ko pehney ya donon ko utaarey. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Ya donon ko nangey karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1650","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab tum mein se kisi key jootey ka tasma toot jaey to doosrey mein na chaley yahan tak ke usey durust karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1651","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aadmi key khadey hokar joota pehen-ney se mana farmaya. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1652","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne gharon mein aag na chhoro jab tum so jao. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1653","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Madina mein aik ghar raat mein apne walon par jal gaya. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko unkey baarey mein khabar di gai to Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ye aag tumhari dushman hai, phir jab tum so jao to usey bujha do. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1654","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bartan dhaanpo, aur mashqeeza baandho, aur darwaazey band karo, aur chiraagh bujha do. Kyonke shaitaan na mashqeeza kholta hai, aur na darwaza kholta hai, aur na bartan kholta hai. Agar tum mein se koi lakdi key siwa na paey jo wo apne bartan par rakhey, aur Allah ka naam zikr karey to karey. Kyonke chuhiya ghar walon par unka ghar jala deti hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Fuwaisiqah: Chuhiya hai, aur tuzrimu: Jala deti hai."
"1655","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Hamein takalluf se mana kya gaya hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1656","Masrooq se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) key paas dakhil huey to unhon-ne kaha: Ae logon! Jo kuchh jaanta hai wo usey kahey, aur jo nahi jaanta wo kahey: Allah behtar jaanta hai. Kyonke ilm mein se hai ke aadmi uskey liye kahey jo wo nahi jaanta: Allah behtar jaanta hai. Allah Taala ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se farmaya: Kaho: Main tum se us par koi ujrat nahi maangta aur na main takalluf karne walon mein se hun. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1657","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mayyit ko uski qabr mein us nohey key sabab azaab diya jaata hai jo us par kya jaey. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Jo us par noha kya gaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1658","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo ham mein se nahi jo gaalon par maarey, aur garebaan phaadey, aur jaahiliyat ki pukaar pukaarey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1659","Abu Burda se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Musa beemar huey aur behosh ho gaey jabke unka sar unkey ghar walon mein se aik aurat ki god mein tha. To wo cheekh key sath ronay lagi, lekin wo usey kuchh jawab dene ki taqat na rakh sakey. Phir jab hosh mein aey to farmaya: Main us se bari hun jis se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bari hain. Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) cheekhney wali, aur moonDney wali, aur phaadney wali se bari hain. (Muttafaqun aleh). Saaliqah wo hai jo nohey aur maatam key sath apni awaz buland karti hai. Aur haaliqah wo hai jo museebat key waqt apna sar moonDti hai. Shaaqqah wo hai jo apna kapda phaadti hai."
"1660","Mugheera bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jis par noha kya jaey to usey qayamat key din us nohey key sabab azaab diya jaeyga jo us par kya gaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1661","Umm Atiya Nusaiba, noon key zamma aur fatha key sath, (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baiyat key waqt ham se ahd liya ke ham noha nahi kareingey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1662","Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abdullah bin Rawaaha (Raziallahu anhu) par behoshi taari hui to unki behan ronay lagi aur kehti thi: Haey mera pahaad, aur is tarah aur is tarah: Un par shumaar karti thi. To jab hosh mein aey to farmaya: Tum ne jo kuchh kaha kya mujh se nahi kaha gaya: Kya tum aise ho?! Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1663","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Saad bin Ubaada (Raziallahu anhu) ne beemari ki shikayat ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki ayadat key liye tashreef laey Abdur Rahman bin Auf aur Saad bin Abi Waqqas aur Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhum) key sath. Phir jab Aap unkey paas dakhil huey to unhey behoshi mein paaya. To farmaya: Kya wo faut ho gaey? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi ya Rasulullah. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) roey. Phir jab logon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka rona dekha to roey. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum nahi suntey? Beshak Allah aankh key aansu se azaab nahi deta, aur na dil key ghum se, lekin is se azaab deta hai, aur apni zabaan ki taraf ishara kya, ya rehem farmata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1664","Abu Maalik Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Noha karne wali agar apni maut se pehley tauba na karey to qayamat key din khadi ki jaeygi jabke us par taarkol ka kurta aur khaarish ka libaas hoga. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1665","Aseed bin Abi Aseed Taabai se baiyat karne waliyon mein se aik aurat se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Us mein tha jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se neki mein liya tha jis mein ham se liya tha ke ham Aap ki nafarmaani nahi kareingey: Ke ham chehra na nochein, aur haey na pukaarein, aur garebaan na phaadein, aur baal na bikhrein. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1666","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mayyit mar jaey aur uska ronay wala khada hokar kahey: Haey mera pahaad, aur haey mera sardar, ya is tarah, to us par do farishtey muqarrar kiye jaatey hain jo usey kachokte hain: Kya tum aise they?! Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Lahz haath ki mutthi se seeney mein dhakka hai."
"1667","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon mein do baatein hain jo unkey sabab kufr hain: Nasab mein taana, aur mayyit par noha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1668","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se logon ne kaahinon key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo kuchh nahi hain. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Wo hamein baaz auqaat kisi baat ki khabar detey hain aur wo sach hoti hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo haq baat hai jisey jinni uchak leta hai aur apne dost key kaan mein daal deta hai. To wo uskey sath sau jhoot mila detey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Bukhari ki aik riwayat mein hai Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak farishtey baadal mein utartey hain, aur wo aasmaan mein faisla ki gai baat ka zikr kartey hain. To shaitaan chhup kar sunta hai aur usey sunta hai, phir usey kaahinon ki taraf wahi karta hai. To wo uskey sath apni taraf se sau jhoot boltey hain. Uska qaul fayaqurruha ya key fatha aur qaaf aur ra key zamma key sath hai, yaani: Usey daal deta hai. Wal'anaan ain key fatha key sath hai."
"1669","Qabeesa bint Abi Ubaid se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baaz azwaaj (Raziallahu anha) se, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo najoomi key paas aey aur us se kisi baat key baarey mein poochhey aur uski tasdeeq karey to uski chaalees din namaz qabool nahi ki jaegi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1670","Qabeesa bin Al-Makhaariq (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Lakeerein khainchna, aur badfaali lena, aur parindon ko udaana jibt mein se hain. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai. Aur farmaya: Tarq parindon ko daudana hai, yaani parindon ko daudana, aur wo hai ke uskey udney se naik faali ley ya badfaali ley. Phir agar wo daayein taraf udey to naik faali ley, aur agar baayein taraf udey to badfaali ley. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Wal'iyaafah lakeer hai. Jauhari ne Sihaah mein kaha: Jibt kalima hai jo but aur kaahin aur jaadugar waghera par bola jaata hai."
"1671","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo sitaaron key ilm mein se haasil karey to us ne jaadu ki shaakh haasil ki, jitna zyada karey utna zyada. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1672","Muawiya bin Al-Hakam (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main jaahiliyat key qareeb ahd wala hun, aur Allah Taala Islam lekar aaya hai, aur beshak ham mein se kuchh aadmi kaahinon key paas aatey hain? Aap ne farmaya: To unkey paas na jao. Main ne kaha: Aur ham mein se kuchh aadmi badfaali letey hain? Aap ne farmaya: Wo chiz hai jo wo apne seenon mein paatey hain, to wo unhey na rokey. Main ne kaha: Aur ham mein se kuchh aadmi lakeerein khainchtey hain? Aap ne farmaya: Ambiya mein se aik Nabi lakeer khainchtey they, phir jo uski lakeer key muwaafiq ho to wahi hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1673","Abu Masood Badri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuttey ki qeemat se, aur zina ki ujrat se, aur kaahin ki mithai se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1674","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chhoot ki beemari nahi hai aur na badfaali hai, aur mujhey naik faali pasand hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur naik faali kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Achchhi baat. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1675","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chhoot ki beemari nahi hai aur na badfaali hai, aur agar nahoosat kisi chiz mein ho to ghar aur aurat aur ghodey mein hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1676","Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) badfaali nahi letey they. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1677","Urwa bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas badfaali ka zikr kya gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Uskey behtreen naik faali hai, aur wo Musalman ko nahi rokti. Phir jab tum mein se koi napasand chiz dekhey to kahey: Ae Allah! Bhalaiyan Terey siwa koi nahi laata, aur buraiyan Terey siwa koi nahi door karta, aur na koi taqat aur na koi quwwat magar Terey sath. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1678","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak jo log ye tasweerein banaatey hain unhey qayamat key din azaab diya jaeyga. Un se kaha jaeyga: Jo tum ne paida kya hai usey zinda karo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1679","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar se tashreef laey jabke main ne apne taaq key aagey tasweeron wala parda latkaaya tha. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey dekha to Aap ka chehra badal gaya aur farmaya: Ae Aaisha! Qayamat key din Allah key nazdeek sab se sakht azaab waley wo hongey jo Allah ki khilqat key sath mushabihat kartey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To ham ne usey kaata aur us se takiya ya do takiye banaey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Qiraam qaaf key kasra key sath hai, wo parda hai. Was sahwah seen muhmala key fatha key sath hai, aur wo chabootra hai jo ghar key saamney hota hai, aur kaha gaya: Wo deewaar mein khidki hai."
"1680","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Har tasweer banaane wala dozakh mein hai, uskey liye har tasweer key badley jo us ne banai hai jaan banai jaeygi aur wo usey dozakh mein azaab degi. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Phir agar tum zaroor karne waley ho to darakht banao aur jo rooh nahi rakhta. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1681","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo duniya mein tasweer banaey to qayamat key din usey takleef di jaeygi ke us mein rooh phunkey aur wo phunka ney wala nahi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1682","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak qayamat key din sab se sakht azaab waley tasweer banaane waley hain. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1683","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah Taala ne farmaya: Aur us se zyada zaalim kaun hai jo meri khilqat jaisi khilqat banaane gaya! To wo zarra paida karein ya daana paida karein, ya jau paida karein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1684","Abu Talha (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farishtey us ghar mein dakhil nahi hotey jis mein kutta ya tasweer ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1685","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Jibraeel se waada kya ke wo Aap key paas aaeingey. To wo dair se aey yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par sakhti hui. To Aap nikley aur Jibraeel miley aur un se shikayat ki. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak ham us ghar mein dakhil nahi hotey jis mein kutta ya tasweer ho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Raasa dair ki, aur wo sa musallasa key sath hai."
"1686","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Jibraeel (Alehis salaam) se aik ghadi mein waada kya ke wo Aap key paas aaeingey. To wo ghadi aai aur wo Aap key paas na aey! Unhon-ne kaha: Aur Aap key haath mein asa thi. To Aap ne usey apne haath se phenk diya jabke Aap farmatey they: Allah apna waada khilaaf nahi karta aur na uskey Rasool. Phir mutawajjah huey to achanak kuttey ka pilla Aap key bistar key neechey tha. To farmaya: Ye kutta kab dakhil hua? To main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam mujhey uski khabar na thi. To Aap ne uskey baarey mein hukm diya aur wo nikaal diya gaya. To Jibraeel (Alehis salaam) Aap key paas aey. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum ne mujh se waada kya tha aur main tumharey liye baitha raha aur tum merey paas na aey. To unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey wo kutta ne roka jo tumharey ghar mein tha. Beshak ham us ghar mein dakhil nahi hotey jis mein kutta ya tasweer ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1687","Abul Hayyaaj Hayyaan bin Husain se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se kaha: Kya main tumhey us par na bhejun jis par mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bheja tha? Ke tum koi tasweer na chhoro magar usey mita do, aur na buland qabr magar usey barabar kar do. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1688","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo kutta paaley siwaey shikaar ya maweshi key kuttey key to uskey ajr mein se har din do qeeraat kami hoti hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Qeeraat."
"1689","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kutta rokhey to uskey amal mein se har din aik qeeraat kami hoti hai siwaey kheti ya maweshi key kuttey key. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Jo kutta paaley jo shikaar ka kutta nahi, aur na maweshi ka aur na zameen ka, to uskey ajr mein se har din do qeeraat kami hoti hai."
"1690","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farishtey us qafiley key sath nahi hotey jis mein kutta ya ghanti ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1691","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghanti shaitaan ki baaja hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1692","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne oonton mein jallaalah par sawaar honay se mana farmaya ke us par sawaar ho. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1693","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Masjid mein thookna gunaah hai, aur uska kaffara usey dafan karna hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur dafan karne se muraad hai jab masjid matti ya rait waghera ki ho to usey uski matti key neechey chhupa dey. Abul Mahaasin Ruyaani hamarey sahaaba mein se apni kitaab Al-Bahr mein ne kaha: Aur kaha gaya: Dafan karne se muraad usey masjid se nikaalna hai. Raha jab masjid pakki ya palastar ki hui ho to usey apne jootey ya ghair se us par ragdey jaisa bahut sey jaahil kartey hain to wo dafan nahi hai, balke gunaah mein izafa hai aur masjid mein gandagi ki kasrat hai. Aur jis ne ye kya us par laazim hai ke uskey baad usey apne kapdey ya haath ya ghair se ponchhey ya dhoey."
"1694","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qibla ki deewaar mein rength ya thook ya balgham dekha aur usey khurach diya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1695","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ye masaajid peshaab aur gandagi mein se kisi chiz key laaiq nahi hain, wo to Allah Taala key zikr key liye hain aur Quran ki qiraat key liye, ya jaisa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1696","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo kisi aadmi ko masjid mein gumshuda chiz pukaartey huey suney to kahey: Allah tumhey wapas na karey. Kyonke masaajid isliye nahi banai gaein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1697","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum usey dekho jo masjid mein baichta ya khareedta hai to kaho: Allah tumhari tijaarat mein nafa na dey. Aur jab tum usey dekho jo gumshuda chiz pukaarta hai to kaho: Allah tumhey wapas na karey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1698","Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne masjid mein pukaara aur kaha: Kaun surkh oont ki taraf bulata hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum na pao. Masaajid to usliye banai gaein hain jisliye banai gaein hain. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1699","Amr bin Shuaib se apne walid se apne dada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masjid mein khareed o farokht se mana farmaya, aur is se ke us mein gumshuda chiz pukaari jaey ya us mein sher padha jaey. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1700","Saaib bin Yazeed Sahaabi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main masjid mein tha to aik aadmi ne mujh par kankari phenki. To main ne dekha to Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) they. To unhon-ne kaha: Jao aur merey paas in donon ko lao. To main unhey unkey paas laaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Tum donon kahaan se ho? To unhon-ne kaha: Ahle Taaif mein se. To unhon-ne kaha: Agar tum donon sheher walon mein se hotey to main tumhey dardnaak saza deta. Tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki masjid mein apni awazein buland kartey ho! Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1701","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo is darakht mein se khaey, yaani lehsan, to hamari masjid key qareeb na aey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Hamari masaajid."
"1702","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo is darakht mein se khaey to hamarey qareeb na aey aur na hamarey sath namaz padhey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1703","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo lehsan ya piyaaz khaey to ham se alag rahey, ya hamari masjid se alag rahey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Jo piyaaz aur lehsan aur gandana khaey to hamari masjid key qareeb na aey, kyonke farishtey us se takleef paatey hain jis se Bani Aadam takleef paatey hain."
"1704","Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Juma key din khutba diya aur apne khutbey mein kaha: Phir beshak tum ae logon do darakht khaatey ho jinhey main khabees key siwa nahi dekhta: Piyaaz aur lehsan. Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke jab Aap masjid mein kisi aadmi se unki boo paatey to uskey baarey mein hukm detey aur wo Baqee ki taraf nikaal diya jaata. Phir jo unhey khaey to pakaa kar maar dey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1705","Muaz bin Anas Juhani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Juma key din ihtiba se mana farmaya jab imam khutba dey raha ho. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1706","Umm Salama (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jiskey paas zibah karne ki qurbaani ho aur Zul Hijja ka chaand nazar aa jaey to wo apne baalon aur naakhunon mein se kuchh na ley yahan tak ke qurbaani karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1707","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala tumhey apne baapon ki qasam khaaney se mana farmata hai. Phir jo qasam khaaney wala ho to Allah ki qasam khaey ya khamosh rahey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Sahih mein aik riwayat mein hai: Phir jo qasam khaaney wala ho wo Allah key siwa qasam na khaey ya khamosh rahey."
"1708","Abdur Rahman bin Samura (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Buton ki qasam na khao aur na apne baapon ki. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Tawaaghi taaghiya ki jama hai, aur wo but hain, aur us mein se hadis hai: Ye Daus ki taaghiya hai, yaani: Unka but aur unka mabood. Aur ghair Muslim mein riwayat kya gaya: Bit tawaagheet, taghoot ki jama, aur wo shaitaan aur but hai."
"1709","Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo amaanat ki qasam khaey wo ham mein se nahi. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1710","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaey aur kahey: Beshak main Islam se bari hun. Phir agar wo jhoota ho to wo waisa hai jaisa us ne kaha, aur agar wo sachcha ho to wo Islam ki taraf salaamat wapas nahi aayega. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"1711","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne aik aadmi ko kehtey huey suna: Kaaba ki qasam nahi. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Allah key siwa qasam na khao, kyonke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo Allah key siwa qasam khaey to us ne kufr kya ya shirk kya. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur baaz ulema ne uskey qaul kafara au ashraka ki tafseer sakhti par ki hai, jaisa riwayat kya gaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Riya shirk hai."
"1712","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kisi Musalman aadmi key maal par uskey haq key baghair qasam khaey to Allah se is haal mein milega ke wo us par ghazabnaak hoga. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham par uski tasdeeq Allah Azza wa Jall ki kitaab se padhi: Beshak jo log Allah key ahd aur apni qasmon key badley thodi qeemat khareedtey hain (Aal-e-Imran: 77), aayat key aakhir tak. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1713","Abu Umaama Iyaas bin Saalaba Haarithi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apni qasam key sath kisi Musalman aadmi ka haq kaat ley to Allah ne uskey liye dozakh waajib kar di hai aur us par Jannat haraam kar di hai. To aik aadmi ne Aap se kaha: Chaahey wo mamuli chiz ho ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Chaahey araak ki tehni ho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1714","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kabeera gunaah hain: Allah key sath shirk karna, aur walidain ki nafarmaani, aur jaan ko qatl karna, aur jhooti qasam. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Ke aik dehaati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kabeera gunaah kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key sath shirk karna. Us ne kaha: Phir kya? Aap ne farmaya: Jhooti qasam. Main ne kaha: Aur jhooti qasam kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Wo jo kisi Musalman aadmi ka maal kaat-ti hai, yaani qasam key sath jis mein wo jhoota hai."
"1715","Abdur Rahman bin Samura (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur jab tum qasam khao aur uskey siwa ko us se behtar dekho to jo behtar hai usey karo aur apni qasam ka kaffara do. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1716","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaey aur uskey siwa ko us se behtar dekhey to apni qasam ka kaffara dey aur jo behtar hai wo karey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1717","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main Allah ki qasam, Insha Allah, qasam nahi khaata phir uskey siwa ko us se behtar dekhta hun magar apni qasam ka kaffara deta hun aur jo behtar hai wo karta hun. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1718","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne ghar walon mein apni qasam par israar karey to wo Allah Taala key nazdeek us se zyada gunaahgaar hai ke wo uska kaffara dey jo Allah ne us par farz kya hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Uska qaul yalijju laam key fatha aur jeem key tashdeed key sath hai, yaani us mein laga rahey aur kaffara na dey. Uska qaul aasimu sa musallasa key sath hai, yaani: Zyada gunaahgaar hai."
"1719","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ye aayat naazil hui: Allah tumhey tumhari laghv qasmon mein nahi pakdega, aadmi key qaul mein: Allah ki qasam nahi, aur kyun nahi Allah ki qasam. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1720","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Qasam saamaan ko farokht karti hai aur kamaai ko mita deti hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1721","Abu Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Khareed o farokht mein kasrat se qasam khaaney se bacho, kyonke wo farokht karti hai phir mita deti hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1722","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah key chehrey key sath sirf Jannat maangi jaey. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kya hai."
"1723","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah key sath panah maangey to usey panah do, aur jo Allah key sath maangey to usey do, aur jo tumhey bulaye to usey qabool karo, aur jo tumharey sath bhalai karey to usey badla do. Phir agar tum wo na pao jis se usey badla do to uskey liye dua karo yahan tak ke tum dekho ke tum ne usey badla de diya hai. Sahih hadis hai, ise Abu Dawud aur Nasaai ne Sahihain ki asaneed key sath riwayat kya hai."
"1724","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Azza wa Jall key nazdeek sab se zaleel naam wo aadmi hai jo shahanshah kehlata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Sufyan bin Uyaina ne kaha: Malikul amlaak jaisa: Shaahin shaah hai."
"1725","Buraida (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Munaafiq ko sardar na kaho, kyonke agar wo sardar ho to tum ne apne Rab Azza wa Jall ko naraaz kya. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1726","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Umm As-Saaib ya Umm Al-Musayyab key paas dakhil huey aur farmaya: Tumhey kya hai ae Umm As-Saaib, ya ae Umm Al-Musayyab, tum kaanp rahi ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Bukhaar hai, Allah us mein barkat na dey. To Aap ne farmaya: Bukhaar ko bura na kaho, kyonke wo Bani Aadam ki khataein door karta hai jaisa bhaati lohey key mail ko door karti hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Tuzafzifeen yaani tez harkat karti ho, aur iskey maana hain: Kaanpti ho. Aur wo ta key zamma aur za key takraar aur fa key takraar key sath hai, aur ra key takraar aur qaafon key sath bhi riwayat kya gaya hai."
"1727","Abul Munzir Ubayy bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hawa ko bura na kaho. Phir jab tum napasand chiz dekho to kaho: Ae Allah! Beshak ham Tujh se is hawa ki bhalai ka sawal kartey hain aur us bhalai ka jo us mein hai aur us bhalai ka jiskey sath usey hukm diya gaya hai, aur ham Teri panah maangtey hain is hawa key shar se aur us shar se jo us mein hai aur us shar se jiskey sath usey hukm diya gaya hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1728","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Hawa Allah ki rehmat mein se hai, wo rehmat lekar aati hai aur azaab lekar aati hai. Phir jab tum usey dekho to usey bura na kaho, aur Allah se uski bhalai maango, aur Allah se uskey shar se panah maango. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka qaul min rauhillah ra key fatha key sath hai, yaani uski apne bandon par rehmat."
"1729","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab tez hawa chalti to farmatey: Ae Allah! Beshak main Tujh se uski bhalai ka sawal karta hun, aur us bhalai ka jo us mein hai, aur us bhalai ka jiskey sath wo bheji gai hai. Aur Teri panah maangta hun uskey shar se, aur us shar se jo us mein hai, aur us shar se jiskey sath wo bheji gai hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1730","Zaid bin Khaalid Juhani (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Murghey ko bura na kaho, kyonke wo namaz key liye jagaata hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1731","Zaid bin Khaalid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Hudaibiya mein subah ki namaz padhai raat ki baarish key baad. Phir jab Aap farigh huey to logon ki taraf mutawajjah huey aur farmaya: Kya tum jaantey ho tumharey Rab ne kya farmaya? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah aur uskey Rasool behtar jaantey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Farmaya: Merey bandon mein se subah kisi ne mujh par imaan key sath ki aur kisi ne mujh se kufr key sath. Raha jis ne kaha: Ham par Allah key fazl aur uski rehmat se baarish hui, to wo mujh par imaan rakhne wala sitaaron ka inkaar karne wala hai. Aur raha jis ne kaha: Ham par fulaan fulaan sitaarey se baarish hui, to wo mujh se kufr karne wala sitaaron par imaan rakhne wala hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur sama yahaan baarish hai."
"1732","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne bhai se kahey: Ae kaafir! To wo donon mein se aik par wapas aati hai. Phir agar wo waisa ho jaisa us ne kaha warna uski taraf wapas aati hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1733","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo kisi aadmi ko kufr key sath pukaarey ya kahey: Allah key dushman! Jabke wo aisa nahi to wo uski taraf wapas aata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Haara wapas aaya."
"1734","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin taana dene wala, laanat karne wala, behaya aur badzabaan nahi hota. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1735","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behayaai jis chiz mein ho usey aibdaar karti hai, aur haya jis chiz mein ho usey zeenat deti hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1736","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hadd se badhney waley halaak ho gaey. Aap ne teen martaba kaha. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Mutanatti'oon: Muamlaat mein mubaalgha karne waley hain."
"1737","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah mardon mein se zubaan ko gaay ki tarah pherne waley faseeh se bughz rakhta hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1738","Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum mein se mujhey sab se zyada mehboob aur qayamat key din mujh se majlis mein sab se qareeb tumharey achchhey akhlaaq waley hain. Aur beshak tum mein se mujhey sab se zyada naapasand aur qayamat key din mujh se sab se door, baatein bananey waley, aur munh phadney waley, aur takabbur se baat karne waley hain. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur uski sharah Husn-e-Khulq key baab mein guzar chuki hai."
"1739","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi na kahey: Mera nafs khabees ho gaya, lekin kahey: Mera nafs sust ho gaya. (Muttafaqun aleh). Ulema ne kaha: Khabusat key maana hain: Ghasayaan, aur wo laqisat key maana hain, lekin khubs ka lafz makrooh samjha gaya."
"1740","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Angoor ko karm na kaho, kyonke karm Musalman hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Kyonke karm momin ka dil hai. Aur Bukhari aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Wo kehtey hain: Karm, karm to momin ka dil hai."
"1741","Waa'il bin Hujr (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Karm na kaho, lekin angoor kaho, aur hablah kaho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Hablah ha aur ba key fatha key sath hai, aur ba key sukoon key sath bhi kaha jaata hai."
"1742","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat aurat se mil kar na rahey aur phir usey apne shohar se bayan karey goya wo usey dekh raha hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1743","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi na kahey: Ae Allah! Mujhey bakhsh dey agar Tu chaahey. Ae Allah! Mujh par rehem farma agar Tu chaahey. Maangney mein pukhta ho, kyonke usey koi majboor karne wala nahi. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Lekin pukhta ho aur raghbat ko bada karey, kyonke Allah Taala ko koi chiz jo wo deta hai badi nahi lagti."
"1744","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi dua maangey to maangney mein pukhta ho, aur na kahey: Ae Allah! Agar Tu chaahey to mujhey ata farma. Kyonke usey koi majboor karne wala nahi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1745","Huzaifa bin Al-Yamaan (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Na kaho: Jo Allah chaahey aur fulaan chaahey, lekin kaho: Jo Allah chaahey, phir fulaan chaahey. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1746","Abu Barza (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Isha se pehley soney ko aur uskey baad baat karne ko makrooh samajhtey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1747","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni zindagi key aakhir mein Isha padhai. Phir jab salaam phera to farmaya: Kya tum apni is raat ko dekhtey ho? Kyonke sau saal key sar par zameen ki peeth par jo hai us mein se koi baqi nahi raheyga. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1748","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka intizaar kya. To Aap unkey paas raat key taqreeban aadhey key qareeb aey aur unhey namaz padhai, yaani Isha. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir ham se khutba farmaya aur farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak logon ne namaz padhi, phir soey. Aur beshak tum namaz mein rahogey jab tak namaz ka intizaar kartey raho. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1749","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apni biwi ko apne bistar ki taraf bulaye aur wo inkaar karey aur wo us par naraaz raat guzaarey to farishtey us par subah tak laanat kartey hain. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Yahan tak ke wo wapas aey."
"1750","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat key liye halaal nahi ke wo roza rakhey jabke uska shohar haazir ho magar uski ijazat key sath, aur na uskey ghar mein ijazat dey magar uski ijazat key sath. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1751","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi nahi darta ke jab wo imam se pehley apna sar uthaye to Allah uska sar gadhey ka sar bana dey! Ya Allah uski soorat gadhey ki soorat bana dey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1752","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne namaz mein kamar par haath rakhne se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1753","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Khaanay ki maujoodgi mein namaz nahi hai, aur na jab wo do khabees rokney waley hon. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1754","Anas bin Maalik se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah ne farmaya: Logon ka kya haal hai jo apni namazon mein apni nigaahein aasmaan ki taraf uthaatey hain! To Aap ka qaul us baarey mein sakht hua yahan tak ke farmaya: Wo is se baaz aaengey ya unki nigaahein uchak li jaengi! Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1755","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se namaz mein idhar udhar dekhney key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo uchak hai jo shaitaan bandey ki namaz se uchak leta hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1756","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Namaz mein idhar udhar dekhney se bacho, kyonke namaz mein idhar udhar dekhna halaakat hai. Phir agar zaroor ho to nafl mein, farz mein nahi. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1757","Abu Marsad Kannaaz bin Al-Husain (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Qabron ki taraf namaz na padho, aur na un par baitho. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1758","Abu Al-Juhaim Abdullah bin Al-Haaris bin As-Simmah Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar namazi key saamney se guzarney wala jaanta ke us par kya hai to chaalees tak khada rehna uskey liye uskey saamney se guzarney se behtar hota. Rawi ne kaha: Mujhey nahi maloom Aap ne chaalees din farmaya, ya chaalees maheena, ya chaalees saal. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1759","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz khadi ki jaey to farz key siwa koi namaz nahi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1760","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raaton mein se Juma ki raat ko qayaam key liye khaas na karo, aur dinon mein se Juma key din ko rozey key liye khaas na karo siwaey iskey ke wo rozey mein ho jo tum mein se koi rakhta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1761","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum mein se koi Juma key din roza na rakhey magar us se pehley ya uskey baad aik din. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1762","Muhammad bin Abbaad se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se poochha: Kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Juma key din rozey se mana farmaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1763","Ummul Momineen Juwairiya bint Al-Haaris (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas Juma key din dakhil huey jabke wo rozedaar thein. To farmaya: Kya tum ne kal roza rakha tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum kal roza rakhna chaahti ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To iftaar karo. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1764","Abu Hurairah aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bisaal se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1765","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bisaal se mana farmaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tum bisaal rakhtey ho? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main tum jaisa nahi hun, beshak mujhey khilaaya aur pilaaya jaata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur ye Bukhari ka lafz hai."
"1766","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi angaarey par baith-ney key liye wo uskey kapdey jala dey aur uski khaal tak pahunch jaey, uskey liye qabr par baith-ney se behtar hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1767","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabr ko pakka karne se, aur us par baith-ney se, aur us par imaarat banaane se mana farmaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1768","Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghulaam bhaag jaey to us se zimma bari ho gaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1769","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Jab ghulaam bhaag jaey to uski namaz qabool nahi ki jaati. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To us ne kufr kya."
"1770","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Quraish ko Makhzoomiya aurat key muamley ne fikr mein daala jis ne chori ki thi. To unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey baarey mein kaun baat kareyga? To unhon-ne kaha: Aur Aap par Usaama bin Zaid key siwa kaun jurrat karega, jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key pyaarey hain. To Usaama ne Aap se baat ki. To Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum Allah Taala ki hadon mein se aik hadd mein sifarish kartey ho? Phir khadey huey aur khutba diya, phir farmaya: Tum se pehley logon ko sirf is ne halaak kya ke wo jab un mein shareef chori karta to usey chhor detey, aur jab un mein kamzor chori karta to us par hadd qaim kartey. Aur Allah ki qasam! Agar Faatima bint Muhammad chori karti to main uska haath kaat-ta. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra badal gaya aur farmaya: Kya tum Allah ki hadd mein sifarish kartey ho? Usaama ne kaha: Merey liye maghfirat maangein ya Rasulullah. Unhon-ne kaha: Phir us aurat ka hukm diya aur uska haath kaata gaya."
"1771","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Laanat ka sabab ban-ney waley do kaamon se bacho. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur laanat ka sabab ban-ney waley do kaam kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Wo jo logon key raastey mein ya unkey saaye mein qazae haajat karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1772","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne thehrey huey paani mein peshaab karne se mana farmaya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1773","Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unkey waalid unhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas laey aur farmaya: Beshak main ne apne is betey ko apna aik ghulaam tohfey mein diya jo mera tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apne har betey ko is jaisa tohfey mein diya hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To usey wapas karo. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum ne apne tamaam beton key sath ye kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Allah se daro aur apni aulaad key darmiyaan insaaf karo. To merey waalid wapas aey aur wo sadqa wapas kar diya. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Basheer! Kya tumharey siwa tumhara beta hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne sab ko is jaisa hibah kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To mujhey gawaah na banao kyonke main zulm par gawaah nahi banta. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Mujhey zulm par gawaah na banao. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Is par ghair ko gawaah banao. Phir farmaya: Kya tumhey pasand hai ke wo tumharey sath husn-e-sulook mein barabar hon? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: To phir nahi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1774","Zainab bint Abi Salama (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Umm Habeeba (Raziallahu anha) jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja hain, key paas dakhil hui jab unkey waalid Abu Sufyan bin Harb (Raziallahu anhu) faut ho gaey they. To unhon-ne khushbu mangwai jis mein zardi khalooq ya ghair thi. To unhon-ne us mein se londi ko lagaya, phir apne gaalon ko chhua. Phir kaha: Allah ki qasam mujhey khushbu ki koi haajat nahi, lekin beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mimbar par farmatey huey suna: Us aurat key liye jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhti hai halaal nahi ke wo mayyit par teen raaton se zyada sog manaey, siwaey shohar par chaar maheena aur das din. Zainab ne kaha: Phir main Zainab bint Jahsh (Raziallahu anha) key paas dakhil hui jab unkey bhai faut ho gaey they. To unhon-ne khushbu mangwai aur us mein se lagaya, phir kaha: Khabardaar! Allah ki qasam mujhey khushbu ki koi haajat nahi, lekin beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mimbar par farmatey huey suna: Us aurat key liye jo Allah aur aakhirat key din par imaan rakhti hai halaal nahi ke wo mayyit par teen se zyada sog manaey siwaey shohar par chaar maheena aur das din. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1775","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sheheri key dehaati key liye baichney se mana farmaya chaahey wo uska maa baap ki taraf se bhai ho. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1776","Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saamaan ko na milo yahan tak ke wo bazaaron mein utaara jaey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1777","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sawaron ko na milo, aur sheheri dehaati key liye na baichey. To Taaoos ne un se kaha: Uska qaul kya hai: Sheheri dehaati key liye na baichey? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo uska dallal na bano. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1778","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sheheri key dehaati key liye baichney se mana farmaya, aur boli na badhao, aur aadmi apne bhai key sauda par sauda na karey, aur apne bhai key paighaam par paighaam na bhejey, aur aurat apni behan key talaaq ka sawal na karey taake wo uskey bartan mein jo hai undel dey. Aur aik riwayat mein farmaya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne istiqbaal se mana farmaya, aur muhaajir key dehaati key liye khareedney se, aur aurat key apni behan key talaaq ki shart lagaaney se, aur aadmi key apne bhai key bhao par bhao lagaaney se, aur najsh aur tasriya se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1779","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi doosrey key sauda par sauda na karey, aur na apne bhai key paighaam par paighaam bhejey magar wo usey ijazat dey. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Muslim ka lafz hai)."
"1780","Uqba bin Aamir se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin momin ka bhai hai, isliye momin key liye halaal nahi ke wo apne bhai key sauda par sauda karey aur na apne bhai key paighaam par paighaam bhejey yahan tak ke wo chhor dey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1781","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala tumharey liye teen pasand farmata hai, aur tumharey liye teen napasand farmata hai: To tumharey liye pasand farmata hai ke tum uski ibaadat karo, aur uskey sath kisi chiz ko shareek na thehrao, aur tum sab Allah ki rassi ko mazboot pakdo aur tafreeq na karo. Aur tumharey liye napasand farmata hai: Qeel-o-qaal, aur kasrat se sawal, aur maal ko zaaya karna. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai, aur uski sharah guzar chuki hai."
"1782","Warraad Mugheera Shoba key kaatib se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Mugheera bin Shoba ne mujh par Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ko khat mein likhwaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har farz namaz key peechey kehtey they: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi, usi key liye baadshahat hai aur usi key liye hamd hai, aur wo har chiz par qaadir hai. Ae Allah! Jo Tune diya usey koi rokne wala nahi, aur jo Tune roka usey koi dene wala nahi, aur kisi dolat waley ko Teri taraf se dolat faeda nahi degi. Aur usey likha ke Aap qeel-o-qaal se, aur maal ko zaaya karne se, aur kasrat se sawal se mana farmatey they. Aur Aap maaon ki nafarmaani se, aur betiyon ko zinda dafan karne se, aur rokne aur maangney se mana farmatey they. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur uski sharah guzar chuki hai)."
"1783","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi apne bhai ki taraf hathyaar se ishara na karey, kyonke wo nahi jaanta shayed shaitaan uskey haath mein kheench ley aur wo dozakh key garhey mein giR padey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein farmaya: Abul Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne apne bhai ki taraf lohey se ishara kya to farishtey us par laanat kartey hain yahan tak ke wo rok dey, chaahey wo uska maa baap ki taraf se bhai ho. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka qaul yanzi'u ain muhmala key sath za key kasra key sath, aur ghain muqta muqta key sath fa key fatha key sath zabt kya gaya hai, aur un donon key maana qareeb hain. Aur muhmala key sath iskey maana hain: Phenkta hai, aur muqta muqta key sath bhi phenkta hai aur bigaadta hai, aur naza ki asal maarna aur fasaad hai."
"1784","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nangey talwaar pakadne se mana farmaya. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1785","Abu Ash-Shaasa se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) key sath masjid mein baithey huey they. To moazzin ne azaan di. To masjid mein se aik aadmi uth kar chalne laga. To Abu Hurairah ne uska peecha apni nazar se kya yahan tak ke wo masjid se nikla. To Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Raha ye, to us ne Abul Qaasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki nafarmaani ki. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1786","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jisey rehaan pesh kya jaey to usey radd na karey, kyonke wo uthaaney mein halka aur khushbu mein achchha hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1787","Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khushbu radd nahi farmatey they. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1788","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aadmi ko suna jo aik aadmi ki tareef kar raha tha aur tareef mein mubaalgha kar raha tha. To farmaya: Tum ne halaak kya, ya aadmi ki peeth tod di. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1789","Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aik aadmi ka zikr kya gaya. To aik aadmi ne uski bhalai mein tareef ki. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum par afsos! Tum ne apne saathi ki gardan kaat di. Usey baar baar kehtey huey. Aur agar tum mein se koi tareef karne wala ho to kahey: Main is is ko gumaan karta hun agar wo usey waisa dekhta hai ke wo waisa hai, aur uska hisaab Allah key paas hai, aur wo Allah par kisi ko paak nahi thehrata. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1790","Hammaam bin Al-Haaris se Miqdaad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ki tareef karne laga. To Miqdaad ne qasad kya aur apne ghutnon par jhukey aur uskey chehrey par kankariyan phenk-ney lagey. To Usman ne un se kaha: Tumhey kya hai? To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum tareef karne walon ko dekho to unkey chehron mein matti phenko. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. To ye ahadis mana mein hain, aur jawaaz mein bahut si sahih ahadis aai hain. Ulema ne kaha: Aur ahadis key darmiyaan jama ka tareeqa ye hai ke kaha jaey: Agar tareef kiye gaey key paas kaamil imaan aur yaqeen ho, aur nafs ki tarbiyat, aur poori marifat ho jisse wo fitney mein na padey, aur na us se dhoka khaey, aur na us se uska nafs kheley, to wo haraam nahi aur na makrooh hai. Aur agar us par in umoor mein se kisi ka khauf ho to uskey munh par uski tareef karna sakht makrooh hai. Aur isi tafseel par mukhtalif ahadis ko utaara jaeyga. Aur jo jawaaz mein aaya hai us mein se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka Abu Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) se qaul hai: Mujhey ummeed hai ke tum un mein se ho, yaani un mein se jo Jannat key tamaam darwaazon se daakhil honay key liye bulaey jaengey. Aur doosri hadis mein hai: Tum un mein se nahi ho, yaani: Tum un mein se nahi ho jo takabbur se apne tehband latkaatey hain. Aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya: Shaitaan tumhey jis raastey par chaltey huey nahi dekhta magar wo tumharey raastey key siwa raasta apnaata hai. Aur jawaaz mein ahadis bahut hain, aur main ne Azkaar kitaab mein unkey itraaf ka jumla zikr kya hai."
"1791","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) Shaam ki taraf nikley yahan tak ke jab Sargh mein they to unhey fauj key ameer miley, Abu Ubaida bin Al-Jarraah aur unkey saathi. To unhon-ne unhey khabar di ke Shaam mein waba phoot padi hai. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: To Umar ne kaha: Merey liye pehley muhaajireen ko bulao. To main ne unhey bulaya aur un se mashwara kya aur unhey khabar di ke Shaam mein waba phoot padi hai. To wo ikhtilaaf karney lagey. To baaz ne kaha: Tum kisi kaam key liye nikley ho aur ham nahi dekhtey ke tum us se wapas aao. Aur baaz ne kaha: Tumharey sath baqi log aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba hain, aur ham nahi dekhtey ke tum unhey is waba par aagey badhao. To unhon-ne kaha: Mujh se uth jao. Phir kaha: Merey liye Ansaar ko bulao. To main ne unhey bulaya aur un se mashwara kya. To wo muhaajireen key raastey par chaley aur unkey ikhtilaaf jaisa ikhtilaaf kya. To unhon-ne kaha: Mujh se uth jao. Phir kaha: Merey liye unhey bulao jo yahaan Quraish key boodhon mein se Fatah key muhaajireen mein se hain. To main ne unhey bulaya aur un mein se do aadmi bhi Aap par ikhtilaaf na karney lagey. To unhon-ne kaha: Ham dekhtey hain ke tum logon ko ley kar wapas aao aur unhey is waba par aagey na badhao. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne logon mein munadi ki: Beshak main subah peeth par hun, isliye subah us par hojao. To Abu Ubaida bin Al-Jarraah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Kya Allah ki taqdeer se bhaag kar? To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Kaash tumharey siwa kehta ae Abu Ubaida! Aur Umar unki mukhaalifat ko napasand kartey they. Haan, ham Allah ki taqdeer se Allah ki taqdeer ki taraf bhaagtey hain. Batao agar tumharey paas oont hon aur tum aisi waadi mein utro jiskey do kinarey hon, aik sarsabz aur doosra khushk. Kya nahi ke agar tum sarsabz mein charao to usey Allah ki taqdeer key sath charaogey, aur agar tum khushk mein charao to usey Allah ki taqdeer key sath charaogey? Unhon-ne kaha: To Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziallahu anhu) aey, jo apni baaz haajat mein ghaaib they. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak merey paas iska ilm hai. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab tum usey kisi zameen mein suno to us par aagey na badho, aur jab wo kisi zameen mein waaqe ho aur tum us mein ho to us se bhaag kar na niklo. To Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Allah Taala ki hamd ki aur wapas aey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Wal'udwah waadi ka kinara hai."
"1792","Usama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum taoon ko kisi zameen mein suno to us mein dakhil na ho, aur jab wo kisi zameen mein waaqe ho aur tum us mein ho to us se na niklo. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1793","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saat halaak karne waley gunaahon se bacho. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur wo kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key sath shirk, aur jaadu, aur us jaan ka qatl jisey Allah ne haraam kya hai siwaey haq key, aur sood khaana, aur yateem ka maal khaana, aur ladai key din peeth pherna, aur paakdaaman ghafil aurton par tohmat lagaana. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1794","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dushman ki zameen ki taraf Quran key sath safar karne se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1795","Umm Salama (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo chaandi key bartan mein peeta hai wo sirf apne pait mein dozakh ki aag bhar raha hai. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai: Ke jo chaandi aur soney key bartan mein khaata ya peeta hai."
"1796","Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein resham aur deebaaj aur soney chaandi key bartanon mein peeney se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Wo unkey liye duniya mein hain aur tumharey liye aakhirat mein. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Sahihain mein Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Resham aur deebaaj na pehno, aur soney chaandi key bartanon mein na piyo aur na unki thaaliyon mein khao."
"1797","Anas bin Seereen se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) key sath Majoos mein se kuchh logon key paas tha. To chaandi key bartan mein faalooda laaya gaya aur unhon-ne na khaaya. To un se kaha gaya: Usey pher do. To usey khalanj key bartan mein pher diya gaya aur wo laaya gaya aur unhon-ne khaaya. Ise Baihaqi ne hasan sanad se riwayat kya hai. Khalanj pyaala hai."
"1798","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aadmi key zaafraan lagaaney se mana farmaya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1799","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh par kusum se rangey huey do kapdey dekhey aur farmaya: Kya tumhari maa ne tumhey iska hukm diya hai? Main ne kaha: Kya main unhey dho dun? Aap ne farmaya: Balke unhey jala do. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To farmaya: Beshak ye kaafiron key kapdon mein se hain, isliye unhey na pehno. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1800","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yaad kya: Bulooghat key baad yateemi nahi, aur raat tak din bhar khamoshi nahi. Khattaabi ne is hadis ki tafseer mein kaha: Jaahiliyat key ibaadat mein khamoshi thi, to Islam mein us se mana kya gaya aur zikr aur bhalai ki baat ka hukm diya gaya."
"1801","Qais bin Abi Haazim se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziallahu anhu) Ahmas ki aik aurat key paas dakhil huey jisey Zainab kaha jaata hai. To unhon-ne usey dekha ke wo nahi bolti. To unhon-ne kaha: Usey kya hai ke wo nahi bolti? To unhon-ne kaha: Us ne khamosh Hajj kya hai. To unhon-ne us se kaha: Bolo kyonke ye halaal nahi hai, ye jaahiliyat key amal mein se hai! To wo boli. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1802","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne baap key siwa ki taraf mansoob ho jabke wo jaanta hai ke wo uskey baap key siwa hai to Jannat us par haraam hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1803","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne baapon se munh na phero. Phir jo apne baap se munh pherey to wo kaafir hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1804","Yazeed bin Shareek bin Taariq se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko mimbar par khutba detey huey dekha. To main ne unhey kehtey huey suna: Allah ki qasam! Hamarey paas koi kitaab nahi jo ham padhtey hain siwaey Allah ki kitaab key, aur jo is saheefey mein hai. To usey phelaaya aur achanak us mein oonton key daant aur zakhmon mein se kuchh cheezein thein. Aur us mein hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Madina Ayr se Saur tak haram hai. Phir jo us mein naya kaam ijaad karey ya nayi cheez laaney waley ko panah dey to us par Allah aur farishton aur tamaam logon ki laanat hai. Allah us se qayamat key din farz aur nafl qabool nahi farmayega. Musalmanon ka zimma aik hai, unka adna usey nibhaata hai. Phir jo Musalman ka ahd todey to us par Allah aur farishton aur tamaam logon ki laanat hai. Allah us se qayamat key din farz aur nafl qabool nahi farmayega. Aur jo apne baap key siwa ki taraf mansoob ho ya apne aaqaon key siwa ki taraf, to us par Allah aur farishton aur tamaam logon ki laanat hai. Allah us se qayamat key din farz aur nafl qabool nahi farmayega. (Muttafaqun aleh). Zimmah ka matlab hai: Unka ahd aur amaan. Aur akhfarahu uska ahd toda. Was sarf tauba hai, aur kaha gaya: Heela hai. Wal'adl fidya hai."
"1805","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo aadmi apne baap key siwa ki taraf mansoob ho jabke wo usey jaanta hai to kufr kya, aur jo wo daawa karey jo uska nahi to wo ham mein se nahi, aur wo dozakh mein apna thikana bana ley. Aur jo kisi aadmi ko kufr key sath pukaarey ya kahey: Allah key dushman! Jabke wo aisa nahi to wo uski taraf wapas aata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh, aur ye Muslim ki riwayat ka lafz hai)."
"1806","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala ghairat farmata hai, aur Allah ki ghairat hai ke aadmi usey aey jo Allah ne us par haraam kya hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1807","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qasam khaey aur apni qasam mein kahey: Laat aur Uzza ki qasam! To kahey: La ilaha illallah. Aur jo apne saathi se kahey: Aao main tum se jua kheloon, to sadqa karey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
